translate schinese partyKate2_ef0583de:

    # mc "Anyway, I figured Ethan could help me deal with this. He could explain to his little brother that you don't do shit like that. You know, very clearly."
    mc "总之，我想伊桑能帮我处理这事。他可以教训他弟弟，让他明白有些事不是能干的。你懂的，说得特别清楚那种。"

translate schinese partyKate2_dd55671a:

    # mc "That way, maybe we'd finally have peace from him."
