    a "嗯，没什么特别的原因。我觉得魔法就是……很有意思。"

translate schinese magicWorldAlice_832756d8:

    # a "I don't know how to answer that. There are just some things that really resonate with us."
    a "我不知道该怎么回答。世界上就是有些东西特别能打动我们。"

translate schinese magicWorldAlice_e139326e:

    # a "Just like one person finds fantasy absurdly boring, I find it incredibly fascinating."
    a "就像有人觉得奇幻题材无聊得要命，我就觉得它迷人极了。"

translate schinese magicWorldAlice_88bfc804:

    # a "Though now that I think about it, is it even still fantasy if it turns out to be real?"
    a "不过现在想想，要是它成真了，那还算「幻想」吗？"

translate schinese magicWorldAlice_79caa63e:

    # mc "Heh, that's a really good question."
    mc "呵，这问题问得真好。"

translate schinese magicWorldAlice_83c25408:

    # a "Right? And a smart one at that."
    a "对吧？而且是个聪明的问题。"

translate schinese magicWorldAlice_aa698869:

    # mc "Yeah, I wouldn't expect anything less from you."
    mc "嗯，你问出这种问题我一点也不意外。"

translate schinese magicWorldAlice_6755faac:

    # magm "Oh heavens, look who we have here. Could it be students come to visit me?"
    magm "哎呀，看看这是谁。莫非是学生来拜访我？"

translate schinese magicWorldAlice_161e972f:

    # a "Looks like he's back."
    a "好像是他回来了。"

translate schinese magicWorldAlice_c057a7db:

    # magm "Oh, you're not my students. I apologize, my old eyes can't see well from a distance anymore."
    magm "哦，你们不是我的学生。抱歉，老人的眼睛看远处已经不行了。"

translate schinese magicWorldAlice_b65e9e98:

    # magm "Greetings, mysterious guests."
    magm "幸会，神秘来客。"

translate schinese magicWorldAlice_9af1d974:

    # mc "Hello, I'm [mc]."
    mc "你好，我是[mc]。"

translate schinese magicWorldAlice_ee75a06b:

    # a "Good afternoon, Mr. Morgrave. My name is Alice."
    a "下午好，莫格雷夫先生。我叫爱丽丝。"

translate schinese magicWorldAlice_eab4a733:

    # magm "I see you are well-mannered young people. Wonderful."
    magm "看来你们是很有礼貌的年轻人。很好。"

translate schinese magicWorldAlice_e7a96b5c:

    # magm "All right then, tell me, what brings you to an old man like me?"
    magm "那好，告诉我，你们来找我这个老头子有什么事？"

translate schinese magicWorldAlice_d906373e:

    # a "We came here to pass the test."
    a "我们是来通过测试的。"

translate schinese magicWorldAlice_698e5f53:

    # magm "Test? What test? As far as I know, you aren't students of this school."
    magm "测试？什么测试？据我所知，你们并不是这所学校的学生。"

translate schinese magicWorldAlice_a2922289:

    # a "That's true, but we need to see the headmaster, and we were told the only way is to pass four tests."
    a "确实，但我们需要见校长，而听说唯一的办法是通过四场测试。"

translate schinese magicWorldAlice_b8422b67:

    # magm "Ohhh, you mean that test. I see, I see."
    magm "哦——，你说的是那个测试。我懂了，我懂了。"

translate schinese magicWorldAlice_31a360c6:

    # magm "Hmmmm..."
    magm "唔嗯……"

translate schinese magicWorldAlice_79b29fbf:

    # magm "Tell me, do you like magic?"
    magm "告诉我，你们喜欢魔法吗？"

translate schinese magicWorldAlice_f5c8d33a:

    # a "Yes!"
    a "喜欢！"

translate schinese magicWorldAlice_0aa1cc6f:

    # mc "Kinda."
    mc "还行吧。"

translate schinese magicWorldAlice_c8ac6c4e:

    # magm "Hoho, I like your enthusiasm, girl."
    magm "呵呵，姑娘，我喜欢你这份热情。"

translate schinese magicWorldAlice_a914e716:

    # a "I love magic. And I'm totally jealous that you can use it whenever you want."
    a "我爱魔法。而且特别嫉妒你们想用就能用。"

translate schinese magicWorldAlice_43d2ba79:

    # magm "Hm?"
    magm "嗯？"

translate schinese magicWorldAlice_11c640b4:

    # magm "Wait, are you telling me you are non-magical?"
    magm "等等，你是说你们不会魔法？"

translate schinese magicWorldAlice_a53981f2:

    # a "Yes. [mc] and I can't use magic."
    a "是的。[mc]和我都不会用魔法。"

translate schinese magicWorldAlice_f438d978:

    # magm "Oh my, that is very interesting. There aren't many of you left in the world."
    magm "哎呀，这可太有意思了。世上像你们这样的人已经不多了。"

translate schinese magicWorldAlice_038f253e:

    # magm "But... Yes... Yes, that works out perfectly."
    magm "不过……好……好，那正好。"

translate schinese magicWorldAlice_3d996037:

    # mc "What are you talking about?"
    mc "你在说什么？"

translate schinese magicWorldAlice_223c736f:

    # magm "Here, young lady. Take this."
    magm "来，姑娘。拿着这个。"

translate schinese magicWorldAlice_cc69efbf:

    # a "Is that... a wand?"
    a "那是……魔杖？"

translate schinese magicWorldAlice_9ec6a0d0:

    # magm "Yes, exactly."
    magm "是的，没错。"

translate schinese magicWorldAlice_154fff05:

    # a "But I don't know how to use magic."
    a "可我不会用魔法。"

translate schinese magicWorldAlice_4ebd3d16:

    # magm "It doesn't matter, just give it a wave."
    magm "没关系，晃一下就行。"

translate schinese magicWorldAlice_3b7322f2:

    # a "What's the point? It won't work anyway."
    a "有什么意义？反正也不会有反应。"

translate schinese magicWorldAlice_494ff883:

    # magm "Trust me, and do it."
    magm "相信我，试一下。"

translate schinese magicWorldAlice_bb8e4b4e_2:

    # a "..."
    a "……"

translate schinese magicWorldAlice_c41d53d6:

    # a "{sc=1}{size=*1.3}What the-?!"
    a "{sc=1}{size=*1.3}什——？！"

translate schinese magicWorldAlice_382516fe:

    # magm "See? Now you're a mage."
    magm "看见了吧？你现在是魔法师了。"

translate schinese magicWorldAlice_d5e72124:

    # mc "{sc=1}A-Alice? How did you-?"
    mc "{sc=1}爱、爱丽丝？你怎么——？"

translate schinese magicWorldAlice_e9a0e4e2:

    # a "{sc=1}I-I don't know. I just... I waved it and it worked on its own."
    a "{sc=1}我、我不知道。我只是……晃了一下，它自己就动了。"

translate schinese magicWorldAlice_d58b5c6d:

    # magm "Hehe, I see you know nothing of this. But that's alright, I'll explain everything."
    magm "嘿嘿，看样子你对此一无所知。不过没关系，我来讲清楚。"

translate schinese magicWorldAlice_d8511d6f:

    # magm "Look at this."
    magm "看这个。"

translate schinese magicWorldAlice_d50fbf16:

    # a "Wooow, that's a lot of wands."
    a "哇，好多魔杖。"

translate schinese magicWorldAlice_cecc1bfe:

    # magm "In the old days, people like you, that is non-magical, were much, much more common."
    magm "在很久以前，像你们这样不会魔法的人要多得多。"

translate schinese magicWorldAlice_b6edffd4:

    # magm "It was back then that these single-spell wands were very popular."
    magm "那时候，这种「单咒魔杖」非常流行。"

translate schinese magicWorldAlice_5863c79e:

    # magm "They differ from regular wands in that they can only cast one specific spell that has been imbued within them."
    magm "它们和普通魔杖的区别在于，只能施放一个被封入其中的特定咒语。"

translate schinese magicWorldAlice_25c90280:

    # magm "They use the mana they've been filled with to function. This means they don't need the user's own mana to work."
    magm "它们靠自身封存的魔力运作。也就是说，使用者本人不需要有魔力。"

translate schinese magicWorldAlice_fa9d848d:

    # magm "The lack of mana in the body is what separates a mage from a non-magical person. And these special wands were created specifically for that group of people."
    magm "体内有无魔力，正是魔法师与常人的区别。而这些特殊魔杖正是为那群人打造的。"

translate schinese magicWorldAlice_70685a56:

    # magm "As time went on, however, non-magical people became fewer and fewer, and these items became relics of the past."
    magm "然而随着时间推移，不会魔法的人越来越少，这类东西就成了遗迹。"

translate schinese magicWorldAlice_ee880a4b:

    # magm "Wands are my hobby, so I collect them from all over the world. I even created some of them myself."
    magm "魔杖是我的爱好，所以我从世界各地收集。有些还是我自己做的。"

translate schinese magicWorldAlice_0c359af3:

    # a "That's... That's amazing! Thanks to this, we can cast spells too, [mc]!"
    a "这……太棒了！靠这个我们也能施咒了，[mc]！"

translate schinese magicWorldAlice_cd763057:

    # mc "Oh god...! Okay, now I'm getting excited too!"
    mc "天哪……！好吧，现在我也兴奋起来了！"

translate schinese magicWorldAlice_c1bd99e5:

    # mc "Can we try them out?"
    mc "我们能试试吗？"

translate schinese magicWorldAlice_00930470:

    # magm "Sure, go ahead."
    magm "当然，请吧。"

translate schinese magicWorldAlice_ee706ee3:

    # mc "Okay, so I just have to wave, right?"
    mc "好，那我只要晃一下就行？"

translate schinese magicWorldAlice_72205397:

    # magm "Yes, that's it."
    magm "对，就这样。"

translate schinese magicWorldAlice_05500ff6:

    # mc "Huh?"
    mc "嗯？"

translate schinese magicWorldAlice_437894f9:

    # mc "Did I just... create a flower?"
    mc "我刚才……变出了一朵花？"

translate schinese magicWorldAlice_2a51d003:

    # mc "Is... is that really it?"
    mc "就……就这？"

translate schinese magicWorldAlice_6cbf34af:

    # magm "Ah, yes. Some spells may seem... less useful than others."
    magm "啊，是的。有些咒语看起来……没那么有用。"

translate schinese magicWorldAlice_8b3af5ab:

    # magm "But hey, if someone wanted to create a beautiful garden in a matter of seconds, that's the solution."
    magm "不过要是有人想在几秒内造出一座美丽花园，那就是解决办法。"

translate schinese magicWorldAlice_92b53e42:

    # a "By the way, how can you tell which wand does what? I don't see any markings on them."
    a "话说，怎么分辨哪根魔杖做什么用？上面一点标记都没有。"

translate schinese magicWorldAlice_54a070b1:

    # magm "Oh, that is one of their biggest flaws. They aren't marked in any way."
    magm "哦，那正是它们最大的缺陷之一。完全没有任何标记。"

translate schinese magicWorldAlice_53496450:

    # magm "When a mage touches one, they can immediately sense what spell is imbued inside. Provided, of course, they know the spell."
    magm "魔法师碰到它就能立刻感知里面封的是什么咒语。当然，前提是他认识那个咒语。"

translate schinese magicWorldAlice_1443a7c7:

    # magm "For example, the wand you're holding right now contains a rather powerful wind spell."
    magm "比如你现在手里这根，封的是一道相当强的风咒。"

translate schinese magicWorldAlice_e967e4ca:

    # a "A wind spell? So, if I wave it, it'll create a strong gust?"
    a "风咒？那我晃一下就会刮起一阵强风？"

translate schinese magicWorldAlice_dea760ae:

    # magm "Yes. Though it's so strong that I wouldn't recommend..."
    magm "是的。不过威力太强，我不建议……"

translate schinese magicWorldAlice_ada1dbdb:

    # mc "{sc=2}{size=*1.4}Ugh!"
    mc "{sc=2}{size=*1.4}呃！"

translate schinese magicWorldAlice_85291571:

    # magm "...pointing it at people."
    magm "……对着人指。"

translate schinese magicWorldAlice_945b544e:

    # a "Oh my god, [mc], I'm sorry! Are you okay?"
    a "天哪，[mc]，对不起！你没事吧？"

translate schinese magicWorldAlice_24b38fe6:

    # mc "I'm fine!"
    mc "我没事！"

translate schinese magicWorldAlice_8bcccf1e:

    # mc "Good thing that tree is growing here. Otherwise I'd be flying down that hill right now."
    mc "幸好这儿有棵树。不然我现在正飞下山坡呢。"

translate schinese magicWorldAlice_135f56bc:

    # mc "Alright, my turn."
    mc "好，该我了。"

translate schinese magicWorldAlice_bb57b312:

    # mc "What does this wand do?"
    mc "这根魔杖做什么用的？"

translate schinese magicWorldAlice_6040f3ec:

    # magm "Hmm, that one has a levitation spell."
    magm "嗯，那根是漂浮咒。"

translate schinese magicWorldAlice_234354fa:

    # magm "It's very useful. With it, you can lift an object without using your own strength."
    magm "非常有用。有了它，你能不费力气就举起东西。"

translate schinese magicWorldAlice_fb8f424f:

    # magm "I suspect these were some of the most popular single-spell wands."
    magm "我敢说这曾是最受欢迎的几种单咒魔杖之一。"

translate schinese magicWorldAlice_4126b906:

    # mc "Levitation, huh?"
    mc "漂浮咒，嗯？"

translate schinese magicWorldAlice_0dfece77:

    # mc "Woow..."
    mc "哇……"

translate schinese magicWorldAlice_4e6fa327:

    # mc "I lifted this piece of wood without any trouble at all. Okay, this is actually really useful."
    mc "我轻轻松松就把这块木头举起来了。好吧，这真的很有用。"

translate schinese magicWorldAlice_3033d544:

    # magm "Exactly, it saves you from carrying heavy objects. You can just float them. Although, there are certain limits."
    magm "没错，它能让你不用搬重物，直接让它们飘起来。当然是有限制的。"

translate schinese magicWorldAlice_68fdca93:

    # a "Man, I'd love to have something like that at home."
    a "天，我家里要是有这种就好了。"

translate schinese magicWorldAlice_31ff9533:

    # mc "Right? It would make so many things easier."
    mc "对吧？能省下好多事。"

translate schinese magicWorldAlice_24ec2034:

    # magm "Oh? Trying to cast that spell on me?"
    magm "哦？想对我用那个咒语？"

translate schinese magicWorldAlice_33545632:

    # magm "Sorry, but not this time."
    magm "抱歉，这次不行。"

translate schinese magicWorldAlice_9bf7b78a:

    # mc "Huh? It didn't work."
    mc "嗯？没反应。"

translate schinese magicWorldAlice_cd260162:

    # magm "I'm not in the mood for flying."
    magm "我不想飞。"

translate schinese magicWorldAlice_89362a12:

    # a "What did you do?"
    a "你做了什么？"

translate schinese magicWorldAlice_b907d905:

    # magm "I cast a negation spell. Very simple but incredibly useful in many situations."
    magm "我施了一道无效化咒。很简单，但在很多情况下极其有用。"

translate schinese magicWorldAlice_6c93c50e:

    # mc "Hah, I bet. I can imagine people lifting others into the air just for fun."
    mc "哈，我信。我能想象有人把别人举到空中纯粹为了好玩。"

translate schinese magicWorldAlice_7605f7a8:

    # magm "Yes, that does happen."
    magm "是的，真的有人这么干。"

translate schinese magicWorldAlice_f31a8802:

    # a "H-Huh?"
    a "嗯、嗯？"

translate schinese magicWorldAlice_e9ea0b8a:

    # a "{sc=1}W-What's happening?"
    a "{sc=1}怎、怎么了？"

translate schinese magicWorldAlice_63be9700:

    # magm "I see, I see. You cast the spell on Miss Alice. I didn't expect that."
    magm "我明白了，我明白了。你把咒语使在爱丽丝小姐身上。真没想到。"

translate schinese magicWorldAlice_5046c599:

    # a "{sc=1}Hey! Put me down!"
    a "{sc=1}喂！放我下来！"

translate schinese magicWorldAlice_6ed8256e:

    # a "{sc=1}Waaaah!"
    a "{sc=1}哇啊啊啊！"

translate schinese magicWorldAlice_3854eb56:

    # a "{sc=1}[mc], this is not funny! It's-it's kinda scary!"
    a "{sc=1}[mc]，一点都不好笑！很、很吓人的！"

translate schinese magicWorldAlice_9a0d7e11:

    # a "{sc=2}Stop it! Do you hear me?!"
    a "{sc=2}住手！你听到没有？！"

translate schinese magicWorldAlice_33d74768:

    # mc "I hear you, I hear you."
    mc "听到了听到了。"

translate schinese magicWorldAlice_15f1971f:

    # a "{sc=2}W-What are you doing?"
    a "{sc=2}你、你在干什么？"

translate schinese magicWorldAlice_857b7f7e:

    # a "{sc=2}{size=*1.2}Watch out!"
    a "{sc=2}{size=*1.2}小心！"

translate schinese magicWorldAlice_5fef7230:

    # a "{sc=2}{size=*1.2}Aaaah!"
    a "{sc=2}{size=*1.2}啊啊啊！"

translate schinese magicWorldAlice_6a4e2d6a:

    # mc "Easy, I've got you."
    mc "没事，我接着你呢。"

translate schinese magicWorldAlice_4ff8db42:

    # a "Haaah... haaah... that was terrifying."
    a "哈啊……哈啊……太吓人了。"

translate schinese magicWorldAlice_1138b62f:

    # a "What was that supposed to be? Have you lost your mind?"
    a "你刚才是要干什么？疯了吗？"

translate schinese magicWorldAlice_5b3b0a8a:

    # mc "Relax, I had everything under control."
    mc "放心吧，一切都在掌控中。"

translate schinese magicWorldAlice_8c58ca85:

    # a "Why didn't you just put me on the ground?"
    a "你干嘛不直接把我放地上？"

translate schinese magicWorldAlice_acb5b779:

    # mc "I just wanted to hug you, and I had a good opportunity!"
    mc "我只是想抱抱你，而且正好有机会！"

translate schinese magicWorldAlice_805df4de:

    # a "{sc=1}...!"
    a "{sc=1}……！"

translate schinese magicWorldAlice_a4b84cc7:

    # a "Dummy."
    a "笨蛋。"

translate schinese magicWorldAlice_9fe9d000:

    # a "Haaaah... God, it feels good to have solid ground under my feet."
    a "哈啊啊……天哪，脚踩在实地上感觉真好。"

translate schinese magicWorldAlice_4f57551d:

    # a "Next time, give me a warning before you do something like that!"
    a "下次干这种事之前先给我个警告！"

translate schinese magicWorldAlice_e5da8253:

    # mc "Okay, okay. Chill, it was just a harmless prank."
    mc "好好好。别生气，只是个无伤大雅的恶作剧。"

translate schinese magicWorldAlice_f6443984:

    # a "Alright, my turn now."
    a "好，该我了。"

translate schinese magicWorldAlice_5c32961a:

    # a "What does this wand do?"
    a "这根魔杖做什么用的？"

translate schinese magicWorldAlice_e67bfccc:

    # magm "Oh, you've stumbled upon a very versatile reflection spell this time."
    magm "哦，这次你捡到了一道非常百搭的反射咒。"

translate schinese magicWorldAlice_84a24503:

    # magm "Its function is very simple. If someone casts a spell at you, you can reflect it, provided you react in time."
    magm "功能很简单。有人对你施咒时，只要你反应够快就能反弹回去。"

translate schinese magicWorldAlice_cef3ff19:

    # magm "That and the negation spell are some of the basic spells we teach at our school."
    magm "这道和无效化咒都是我们学校教的基础咒语。"

translate schinese magicWorldAlice_8fc317a6:

    # a "Sounds good. Can we try it out?"
    a "听起来不错。能试试吗？"

translate schinese magicWorldAlice_0cfbb165:

    # magm "Of course. I'll cast a levitation spell on you, and you try to reflect it."
    magm "当然。我对你施漂浮咒，你试着反弹。"

translate schinese magicWorldAlice_e7554708:

    # magm "Imagine my spell is like a stone flying toward you at high speed. Just deflect it with a wave of your wand."
    magm "想象我的咒语是一块高速飞向你的石头。用魔杖一挥把它打回去就行。"

translate schinese magicWorldAlice_ae0bfbdb:

    # a "Alright, I'll try."
    a "好，我试试。"

translate schinese magicWorldAlice_d27f5bcb:

    # mc "(Hmmm... there are so many wands here.)"
    mc "（唔嗯……这里好多魔杖。）"

translate schinese magicWorldAlice_437b4f7c:

    # mc "(They really do all look the same. There's no way to tell them apart.)"
    mc "（看起来真的都一样。完全分不出来。）"

translate schinese magicWorldAlice_2b35b6fe_2:

    # mc "..."
    mc "……"

translate schinese magicWorldAlice_b424a9f7:

    # mc "I wonder what..."
    mc "我在想……"

translate schinese magicWorldAlice_73e5be9d:

    # mc "I wonder what would happen if I used several at once."
    mc "我在想如果同时用好几根会怎样。"

translate schinese magicWorldAlice_2b35b6fe_3:

    # mc "..."
    mc "……"

translate schinese magicWorldAlice_fdff02b0:

    # mc "(There's only one way to find out.)"
    mc "（只有一个办法能知道。）"

translate schinese magicWorldAlice_bf248df3:

    # a "Mr. Morgrave, what is this wand for? I just waved it and nothing happened."
    a "莫格雷夫先生，这根魔杖是做什么的？我刚才晃了一下，什么都没发生。"

translate schinese magicWorldAlice_894d741d:

    # magm "Let me check."
    magm "我看看。"

translate schinese magicWorldAlice_f12dd899:

    # magm "Ah, it's a spell that shows one second into the future to the person it was cast upon."
    magm "啊，这是能让被施咒者看到未来一秒的咒语。"

