    mc "瓦妮莎？发生什么了？"

translate schinese VanessaWakeUp_e1fcb1b5:

    # v "Umm..."
    v "呃……"

translate schinese VanessaWakeUp_610e70b7:

    # magv "That's impossible!"
    magv "不可能！"

translate schinese VanessaWakeUp_343c1e11:

    # magv "What the hell happened in here?!"
    magv "这屋里到底发生了什么？！"

translate schinese VanessaWakeUp_218e3275:

    # magv "How on earth did you wake up?!"
    magv "你到底是怎么醒过来的？！"

translate schinese VanessaWakeUp_05500ff6:

    # mc "Huh?"
    mc "嗯？"

translate schinese VanessaWakeUp_414f63c3:

    # mc "Who are you?"
    mc "你是谁？"

translate schinese VanessaWakeUp_367d964a:

    # magv "{size=*1.2}How did you wake up? Speak!"
    magv "{size=*1.2}你是怎么醒的？说！"

translate schinese VanessaWakeUp_36413912:

    # magv "{size=*1.2}I need to know the truth! Quickly!"
    magv "{size=*1.2}我必须知道真相！快！"

translate schinese VanessaWakeUp_c1972a58:

    # v "Hey, what the hell are you doing? Maybe calm down a bit, okay?"
    v "喂，你在干什么？先冷静一点好吗？"

translate schinese VanessaWakeUp_f017709c:

    # v "He just woke up. Let him gather his senses."
    v "他才刚醒。让他先缓一缓。"

translate schinese VanessaWakeUp_12f32e97:

    # magv "Grrr..."
    magv "呃……"

translate schinese VanessaWakeUp_37b34843:

    # mc "It's okay, Vanessa. I feel fine."
    mc "没事，瓦妮莎。我感觉很好。"

translate schinese VanessaWakeUp_9ab15545:

    # v "Are you sure?"
    v "你确定？"

translate schinese VanessaWakeUp_c3ee152d:

    # mc "Yeah. I might be a little sleepy, but it's nothing."
    mc "嗯。可能有点困，但没什么。"

translate schinese VanessaWakeUp_fca0e46f:

    # mc "Anyway, can someone tell me what's going on here?"
    mc "总之，谁能告诉我这里怎么回事？"

translate schinese VanessaWakeUp_a38dad07:

    # magv "The two of you were in the middle of conducting a test."
    magv "你们两个刚才在进行一场测试。"

translate schinese VanessaWakeUp_7eaa5196:

    # mc "Huh? So it was test?"
    mc "嗯？所以真的是测试？"

translate schinese VanessaWakeUp_ee2149fe:

    # magv "Yes. You were put to sleep, and the task was to wake you up. She was supposed to do it."
    magv "是的。把你催眠了，任务就是把你叫醒。本来该由她来做。"

translate schinese VanessaWakeUp_859608ba:

    # magv "But you... somehow you woke up on your own. Tell me how you did it."
    magv "可是你……不知怎么的自己醒了。告诉我你是怎么做到的。"

translate schinese VanessaWakeUp_d86da407:

    # magv "It's a fairly strong spell, and I'm currently researching various ways to counteract it. I already know a few good methods, but..."
    magv "那是很强的咒语，我正在研究各种对抗手段。我已经知道几种有效方法，可是……"

translate schinese VanessaWakeUp_b98995b5:

    # magv "You're the first person who's ever managed to break out on their own. That's fascinating. What did you do?"
    magv "你是第一个靠自己挣脱出来的人。太有意思了。你做了什么？"

translate schinese VanessaWakeUp_f0772f46:

    # mc "Umm, I don't know. I just really focused on waking up and suddenly... I was awake."
    mc "嗯，我不知道。我只是拼命想着要醒来，然后突然……就醒了。"

translate schinese VanessaWakeUp_0ba48d35:

    # magv "You focused? You're telling me you were conscious the entire time?"
    magv "你集中精神？你是说全程都有意识？"

translate schinese VanessaWakeUp_15dd09c0:

    # mc "I think so... I mean, it was like a dream. Like I was sleeping and daydreaming at the same time."
    mc "我想是吧……我的意思是，就像做梦一样。像是睡觉的同时还在做白日梦。"

translate schinese VanessaWakeUp_ef1b43ba:

    # mc "Everything around me was empty, but I was aware. I could think normally."
    mc "周围一片空白，但我有意识。我能正常思考。"

translate schinese VanessaWakeUp_8b60da37:

    # magv "Hmmm, that's interesting. Yes, very, very interesting."
    magv "唔嗯，有意思。是啊，非常非常有意思。"

translate schinese VanessaWakeUp_124a38fc:

    # magv "Well, thanks to you, I've gathered some data to analyze, so I can't say you were useless."
    magv "多亏了你，我收集到一些可以分析的数据，所以不能说你没用。"

translate schinese VanessaWakeUp_52ad8007:

    # magv "I just hope I'll be able to get something meaningful out of it."
    magv "只希望我能从里面得出点有意义的东西。"

translate schinese VanessaWakeUp_c5c8efb9:

    # magv "Anyway, thank you for your help. You may go."
    magv "总之，谢谢你的帮忙。你可以走了。"

translate schinese VanessaWakeUp_dd2c438a:

    # v "Hold on a sec. What about our test?"
    v "等一下。我们的测试呢？"

translate schinese VanessaWakeUp_43483de2:

    # v "We came here for the password."
    v "我们是来拿密码的。"

translate schinese VanessaWakeUp_f861a94a:

    # magv "Ah, right, right. Even though it didn't go exactly as planned, I'm still satisfied."
    magv "啊，对对对。虽然没完全按计划进行，但我还是满意。"

translate schinese VanessaWakeUp_11631586:

    # magv "My part of the password is \"little\". No need to thank me."
    magv "我这段密码是「小」。不用谢我。"

translate schinese VanessaWakeUp_ce5b17a2:

    # v "Great."
    v "太好了。"

translate schinese VanessaWakeUp_f54b6960:

    # magv "Now get lost, I have things to do."
    magv "现在滚吧，我还有事。"

translate schinese VanessaWakeUp_e3b2cbf1:

    # v "Can you walk, [mc]?"
    v "你能走吗，[mc]？"

translate schinese VanessaWakeUp_cf1adef2:

    # mc "Yeah."
    mc "能。"

translate schinese VanessaWakeUp_4dbad615:

    # v "Then let's go."
    v "那就走吧。"

translate schinese VanessaWakeUp_f75c7c1b:

    # v "How much longer do we have to wait? You said he should wake up in a few minutes."
    v "我们还要等多久？你说几分钟就会醒的。"

translate schinese VanessaWakeUp_6729d590:

    # magv "Patience, woman. It's an experiment."
    magv "耐心点，女士。这是实验。"

translate schinese VanessaWakeUp_4ecfce82:

    # v "How am I supposed to be patient when he's been unconscious for so long? Are you sure he's okay?"
    v "他都昏迷这么久了，我怎么耐心得下来？你确定他没事吗？"

translate schinese VanessaWakeUp_710e07f9:

    # magv "He's fine. How many times are you going to ask that?"
    magv "他没事。你要问几遍？"

translate schinese VanessaWakeUp_540f4036:

    # v "Until he wakes up."
    v "问到他醒为止。"

translate schinese VanessaWakeUp_df761beb:

    # magv "For Loren's balls, you're so goddamn annoying. Better not have children, because they'll have a miserable life."
    magv "看在老天的份上，你真他妈烦人。以后别生孩子了，不然孩子会过得很惨。"

translate schinese VanessaWakeUp_3bf0cfa5:

    # v "Well, I actually already have two kids and-{p=1}{nw}"
    v "我其实已经有两个孩子了，而且——{p=1}{nw}"

translate schinese VanessaWakeUp_64db7cc1:

    # mc "{bt=1}Mmmmmm..."
    mc "{bt=1}唔嗯嗯嗯……"

translate schinese VanessaWakeUp_76e7bc07:

    # v "[mc]!"
    v "[mc]！"

translate schinese VanessaWakeUp_e4459dd3:

    # magv "See? Told you."
    magv "看吧？我说了。"

translate schinese VanessaWakeUp_c7f82213:

    # mc "Wh-What's going on?"
    mc "发、发生什么了？"

translate schinese VanessaWakeUp_bb019795:

    # mc "Where am I?"
    mc "我在哪儿？"

translate schinese VanessaWakeUp_ce1ada78:

    # v "Everything is fine. You're safe."
    v "一切都没事。你很安全。"

translate schinese VanessaWakeUp_1d0abf41:

    # mc "What? What are you talking about?"
    mc "什么？你在说什么？"

translate schinese VanessaWakeUp_ab650efe:

    # v "It was just a test."
    v "只是场测试而已。"

translate schinese VanessaWakeUp_e1b9c9b9:

    # mc "Huh? A test?"
    mc "嗯？测试？"

translate schinese VanessaWakeUp_4ec89041:

    # v "Yes. As you were walking here, Mr. Varen cast a spell on you that put you to sleep."
    v "是的。你走过来的时候，瓦林先生对你施了一个让你睡着的咒语。"

translate schinese VanessaWakeUp_1ac5356b:

    # v "My task was to wake you up. Which, as you can see, was a success."
    v "我的任务就是把你叫醒。你也看到了，成功了。"

translate schinese VanessaWakeUp_3d8adc17:

    # magv "Allow me to explain briefly."
    magv "容我简要解释一下。"

translate schinese VanessaWakeUp_09d6a401:

    # magv "I am currently researching a rather powerful spell. To wake a sleeping person, they must be subjected to strong stimuli. It's quite fascinating and one of a kind."
    magv "我目前在研究一个相当强力的咒语。要叫醒一个睡着的人，必须让他受到强烈刺激。这非常有趣，而且独一无二。"

translate schinese VanessaWakeUp_10677b5e:

    # magv "The problem is, I don't know yet how strong those stimuli need to be or of what kind. I have several proven methods, but I still lack enough data to have a full picture."
    magv "问题是，我还不知道需要多强、什么样的刺激。我有几种经过验证的方法，但数据仍然不够，无法得出完整结论。"

translate schinese VanessaWakeUp_6041297b:

    # magv "That's why every now and then I need a person to let themselves be put to sleep so I can test more methods."
    magv "所以我每隔一段时间就需要一个自愿被催眠的人，好让我测试更多方法。"

translate schinese VanessaWakeUp_278c24c3:

    # magv "Unfortunately, for some reason, fewer and fewer people are volunteering, and the headmaster banned me from conducting research on students. Luckily, you two showed up."
    magv "可惜不知为何，自愿的人越来越少，校长也禁止我在学生身上做研究。所幸你们出现了。"

translate schinese VanessaWakeUp_bae14100:

    # mc "So... I was asleep and you woke me up?"
    mc "所以……我睡着了，然后你把我叫醒？"

translate schinese VanessaWakeUp_fc994e9c:

    # v "Yes, exactly."
    v "对，正是如此。"

translate schinese VanessaWakeUp_d8e725f6:

    # mc "Then why didn't you just tell me? Why did you guys cast the spell from the shadows?"
    mc "那你为什么不直接告诉我？为什么要在暗处施咒？"

translate schinese VanessaWakeUp_1ee4e34d:

    # v "Mr. Varyn said that is the nature of this spell. If you cast it on someone who is aware of it, it won't work."
    v "瓦林先生说这就是这个咒语的性质。如果对方有意识，咒语就不会生效。"

translate schinese VanessaWakeUp_70aac4cb:

    # mc "Oh, I see."
    mc "哦，我明白了。"

translate schinese VanessaWakeUp_b2be3293:

    # mc "Wait, does that mean we passed the test?"
    mc "等等，那是不是说我们通过测试了？"

translate schinese VanessaWakeUp_3329789a:

    # magv "Yes. The password is \"little\"."
    magv "是的。密码是「小」。"

translate schinese VanessaWakeUp_f4e0031e:

    # mc "Oh. Okay, that was quick. Thanks."
    mc "哦。这么快。谢谢。"

translate schinese VanessaWakeUp_4467dc66:

    # mc "By the way, how did you wake me up?"
    mc "话说，你是怎么把我叫醒的？"

translate schinese VanessaWakeUp_71026a41:

    # v "Oh, umm... at first, I had to massage you a bit. Touch you in a few places, and then..."
    v "哦，呃……一开始，我得先给你按摩一下。摸了你几个地方，然后……"

translate schinese VanessaWakeUp_68f933cd:

    # v "I hope it's not a problem, but I... I had to kiss you. Not just a peck, but in a more... adult way."
    v "希望你别介意，但我……我得亲你。不是轻轻一下，而是更……更成人一点的方式。"

translate schinese VanessaWakeUp_f06a1d03:

    # mc "Huh? Y-You...?"
    mc "嗯？你、你……？"

translate schinese VanessaWakeUp_a31340dd:

    # mc "Really?"
    mc "真的？"

translate schinese VanessaWakeUp_4cf4e7be:

    # v "Mhmm."
    v "嗯。"

translate schinese VanessaWakeUp_b8de06d3:

    # mc "Oh."
    mc "哦。"

translate schinese VanessaWakeUp_a2fe95a9:

    # mc "No, I... It's not a problem. It's fine."
    mc "不，我……我不介意。没关系。"

translate schinese VanessaWakeUp_c9f5a8c8:

    # v "I'm glad."
    v "那就好。"

translate schinese VanessaWakeUp_01524543:

    # magv "{sc=1}{size=*1.2}Ahem!"
    magv "{sc=1}{size=*1.2}咳咳！"

translate schinese VanessaWakeUp_24a2bdc7:

    # magv "Since the test is over, get out of here. I've gathered a lot of data thanks to you, and I need to analyze it."
    magv "既然测试结束了，滚出这里。多亏你们我拿到了大量数据，得去分析。"

translate schinese VanessaWakeUp_e3b2cbf1_1:

    # v "Can you walk, [mc]?"
    v "你能走吗，[mc]？"

translate schinese VanessaWakeUp_cf1adef2_1:

    # mc "Yeah."
    mc "能。"

translate schinese VanessaWakeUp_4dbad615_1:

    # v "Then let's go."
    v "那就走吧。"

translate schinese VanessaWakeUp_430e6a7b:

    # mc "Alright, that was officially the easiest test of my life."
    mc "好吧，这绝对是我经历过最轻松的测试。"

translate schinese VanessaWakeUp_9bd856fc:

    # mc "It's a shame they don't have tests like that in our schools. You show up, lie down on a desk, sleep for an hour, and you pass."
    mc "真可惜我们学校没这种测试。你只要出现，往桌上一趴，睡一小时，就过了。"

translate schinese VanessaWakeUp_89227eb7:

    # v "Tests are meant to verify your knowledge, [mc]. How are teachers supposed to do that if you're sleeping?"
    v "测试是用来检验你的知识的，[mc]。你睡着了老师还怎么考？"

translate schinese VanessaWakeUp_590f85df:

    # mc "I know, I know. It was just a joke."
    mc "知道知道。开玩笑的。"

translate schinese VanessaWakeUp_3c2ae0f9:

    # v "By the way, I owe you an apology."
    v "话说，我该向你道歉。"

translate schinese VanessaWakeUp_d50e8df4:

    # mc "An apology? For what?"
    mc "道歉？为了什么？"

translate schinese VanessaWakeUp_f0aa8ed9:

    # v "Well, I kind of tricked you, didn't I?"
    v "嗯，我算是骗了你，对吧？"

translate schinese VanessaWakeUp_c78e1668:

    # v "When you were on your way, I was shouting just to mislead you, but I knew Mr. Varyn was going to cast that spell."
    v "你走过来的时候，我大喊大叫只是为了误导你，但我知道瓦林先生会施那个咒语。"

translate schinese VanessaWakeUp_d520dd95:

    # v "I did it because the test required it, but... I feel a bit bad about it."
    v "我那么做是因为测试需要，但……我心里还是有点过意不去。"

translate schinese VanessaWakeUp_3b3c71c5:

    # mc "Oh come on, it's no big deal. Really."
    mc "哎，别这么说。真的没关系。"

translate schinese VanessaWakeUp_5ba24d23:

    # mc "Besides, if I remember correctly, you shouted then that everything will be fine, right?"
    mc "而且如果我没记错，你当时喊的是「一切都会好」，对吧？"

translate schinese VanessaWakeUp_8aa66291:

    # mc "And look at me. I'm perfectly fine. Just as you said."
    mc "你看我，不是好好的吗。就像你说的。"

translate schinese VanessaWakeUp_3fe06278:

    # mc "In that case, you didn't trick me at all."
    mc "那你根本就没骗我。"

translate schinese VanessaWakeUp_2a5204ea:

    # v "Heh, alright. I like your way of thinking."
    v "呵，好吧。我喜欢你的说法。"

translate schinese VanessaWakeUp_51426fb8:

    # v "And your head? It doesn't hurt?"
    v "那你的头呢？不疼吗？"

translate schinese VanessaWakeUp_b409328a:

    # mc "Why would it?"
    mc "为什么会疼？"

translate schinese VanessaWakeUp_e2e63e9a:

    # v "You were lying on the ground when we got to you, so you probably hit it when you fell."
    v "我们赶到的时候你躺在地上，摔倒的时候大概撞到了。"

translate schinese VanessaWakeUp_13003193:

    # v "Mr. Varyn did cast some healing spell, but I'd rather be sure."
    v "瓦林先生确实施了个治愈咒，不过我还是想确认一下。"

translate schinese VanessaWakeUp_ca45704d:

    # mc "He did something like that? To be honest, I got the impression he was a pretty unpleasant guy, but maybe I was wrong."
    mc "他还做了这种事？说实话，我本来觉得他是个挺让人不愉快的家伙，也许是我误会了。"

translate schinese VanessaWakeUp_26834d90:

    # v "He's a teacher after all."
    v "他毕竟是老师。"

translate schinese VanessaWakeUp_aee49a4f:

    # mc "Right. No, don't worry about it. Nothing hurts."
    mc "对。不用担心，什么都不疼。"

translate schinese VanessaWakeUp_c9f5a8c8_1:

    # v "I'm glad."
    v "那就好。"

translate schinese VanessaWakeUp_a2e78794:

    # mc "So, during that test... all you did was a massage and a kiss, right?"
    mc "所以那场测试……你只做了按摩和一个吻，对吧？"

translate schinese VanessaWakeUp_cfe5a118:

    # v "...?!"
    v "……？！"

translate schinese VanessaWakeUp_36aede11:

    # v "Yes. Why do you ask?"
    v "对。为什么这么问？"

translate schinese VanessaWakeUp_cd53b33f:

    # mc "Umm, you see, as it happens, while I was unconscious... I had a dream."
    mc "嗯，那个……其实我昏迷的时候……做了个梦。"

translate schinese VanessaWakeUp_f1f467c2:

    # v "About what?"
    v "梦见什么？"

translate schinese VanessaWakeUp_889e64de:

    # mc "About you."
    mc "梦见你。"

translate schinese VanessaWakeUp_44ac5976:

    # v "I was in your dream?"
    v "我出现在你的梦里？"

translate schinese VanessaWakeUp_a445a0d3:

    # mc "Yeah, and you were..."
    mc "对，而且你……"

translate schinese VanessaWakeUp_17b6263f:

    # mc "Okay, I'm about to sound like a total pervert, so please remember it was just a dream and I had zero control over it."
    mc "接下来我听起来会像个彻底的变态，请记住那只是梦，我一点都控制不了。"

translate schinese VanessaWakeUp_2b231428:

    # mc "You were doing some pretty dirty stuff with me."
    mc "你和我做了一些很色的事。"

translate schinese VanessaWakeUp_168981b2:

    # v "Huuuuh?"
    v "呜呜呜？"

translate schinese VanessaWakeUp_411992db:

    # v "It's probably normal for boys your age to have dreams like that, right?"
    v "你们这个年纪的男生做这种梦很正常吧？"

translate schinese VanessaWakeUp_0fe225a8:

    # mc "W-Well, maybe. I don't know. It was just very... real."
    mc "呃……也许吧。我不知道。只是那感觉太……太真实了。"

translate schinese VanessaWakeUp_e4df3645:

    # mc "This is a stupid question, but... nothing like that actually happened, right?"
    mc "这个问题很蠢，但……那种事真的没发生吧？"

translate schinese VanessaWakeUp_6af9dad4:

    # v "Who knows? Maybe it did, and maybe it didn't."
    v "谁知道呢？也许发生了，也许没有。"

translate schinese VanessaWakeUp_b2c77c2f:

    # mc "Oh come on, you can't just answer like that."
    mc "哎，你不能这么回答。"

translate schinese VanessaWakeUp_76b2929b:

    # v "What, you'd want it to be true?"
    v "怎么，你希望那是真的？"

translate schinese VanessaWakeUp_4fdeb17e:

    # mc "Okay, I'll be honest. It kind of turns me on, so yes. I'd want that."
    mc "好吧，我说实话。确实让我有点兴奋，所以对，我希望是真的。"

translate schinese VanessaWakeUp_94743f9c:

    # v "{i}*Giggles*{/i} [mc], you pervert."
    v "{i}*咯咯笑*{/i} [mc]，你这个小变态。"

translate schinese VanessaWakeUp_5973e3d7:

    # mc "No. It would be a bit weird if something like that happened while I was unconscious."
    mc "不。要是我昏迷的时候真发生了那种事，那也太奇怪了。"

translate schinese VanessaWakeUp_d69340a2:

    # mc "I don't think I'd feel good about it."
    mc "我觉得我不会有好受的。"

translate schinese VanessaWakeUp_c9563a42:

    # v "Yeah, that's understandable."
    v "嗯，这我理解。"

translate schinese VanessaWakeUp_77476d41:

    # mc "It doesn't matter. I'm just asking out of pure curiosity."
    mc "算了。我只是纯粹好奇才问的。"

translate schinese VanessaWakeUp_6c0a2c46:

    # v "I see."
    v "我明白了。"

translate schinese VanessaWakeUp_5575a8ca:

    # mc "Who knows? Maybe yes, maybe no."
