translate schinese magicWorldEnd_ae437070:

    # magd "Unfortunately, I have to disappoint you, boy. I probably won't be able to answer any of your questions."
    magd "很遗憾，我得让你失望了，年轻人。我恐怕回答不了你的任何问题。"

translate schinese magicWorldEnd_72d80bea:

    # mc "Wait, what? Why?"
    mc "等等，什么？为什么？"

translate schinese magicWorldEnd_8250da72:

    # magd "Because I don't know that woman."
    magd "因为我不认识那个女人。"

translate schinese magicWorldEnd_815fa91d:

    # magd "I have no idea who she is, how on earth she got in there, or what her motive was."
    magd "我完全不知道她是谁，不知道她究竟怎么混进去的，也不知道她的目的。"

translate schinese magicWorldEnd_0f73ccba:

    # magd "In short, I know nothing about her."
    magd "简而言之，我对她一无所知。"

translate schinese magicWorldEnd_0e9ca712:

    # mc "What? No, but that's... that's impossible."
    mc "什么？不，可是这……这不可能。"

translate schinese magicWorldEnd_9f32c4b5:

    # mc "Are you... are you sure?"
    mc "你……你确定吗？"

translate schinese magicWorldEnd_80cf2dda:

    # magd "Yes, I'm sure."
    magd "是的，我确定。"

translate schinese magicWorldEnd_3cc2267b:

    # r "That makes no sense. If you don't know her, why was she there with you?"
    r "这说不通。你不认识她，那她为什么会和你在一起？"

translate schinese magicWorldEnd_c88b1b23:

    # magd "She came there without my invitation. What's more, she threatened me, so I wasn't able to do anything."
    magd "她不是我邀请来的。更过分的是，她还威胁了我，让我什么都做不了。"

translate schinese magicWorldEnd_11537600:

    # mc "Threatened you?"
    mc "威胁你？"

translate schinese magicWorldEnd_aa20091b:

    # magd "Yes. At the moment I wanted to cancel your match, she held a knife to me and told me not to do it."
    magd "是的。就在我想取消你比赛的时候，她拿刀顶着我，命令我不许取消。"

translate schinese magicWorldEnd_af404351:

    # magd "As soon as your fight ended, she stepped through a portal and I never saw her again."
    magd "你的比赛一结束，她就穿过一扇传送门消失了，我再也没见过她。"

translate schinese magicWorldEnd_1206e52b:

    # a "A portal!"
    a "传送门！"

translate schinese magicWorldEnd_21f4bdd9:

    # k "That means she's a Guardian, right? [mc] was right."
    k "那就说明她是守护者，对吧？[mc] 猜对了。"

translate schinese magicWorldEnd_aa6fc626:

    # mc "Yes, but that doesn't get us anywhere. The trail ends here, we have no further lead."
    mc "是啊，但这对我们没什么帮助。线索就断在这里，再也查不下去了。"

translate schinese magicWorldEnd_9ea7fcf1:

    # k "Oh, right..."
    k "哦，对哦……"

translate schinese magicWorldEnd_025118cc:

    # a "Shit..."
    a "可恶……"

translate schinese magicWorldEnd_7f55a628:

    # r "No, it's not over yet."
    r "不，还没结束。"

translate schinese magicWorldEnd_b2b9e19d:

    # mc "What do you mean?"
    mc "你什么意思？"

translate schinese magicWorldEnd_e06b19fd:

    # r "There's something else, isn't there, old man?"
    r "还有别的事对吧，老头？"

translate schinese magicWorldEnd_d79fee75:

    # r "You said {i}\"she was right\"{/i} when we asked about her."
    r "我们问起她的时候，你说{i}「她说得没错」{/i}。"

translate schinese magicWorldEnd_00447e5b:

    # r "That means you were expecting us... or rather she expected us to come to you. Am I right?"
    r "那就说明你在等我们……或者说，是她在等我们去找你。我说得对吗？"

translate schinese magicWorldEnd_91a1b31e:

    # magd "Sharp observation. I see you're quite perceptive, young lady."
    magd "观察力很敏锐。看来你相当聪明，小姑娘。"

translate schinese magicWorldEnd_c950913c:

    # mc "So what's the deal?"
    mc "那么，这是怎么回事？"

translate schinese magicWorldEnd_48440188:

    # magd "That woman left something for you."
    magd "那个女人留了一样东西给你们。"

translate schinese magicWorldEnd_def0ad19:

    # mc "What is it?"
    mc "什么东西？"

translate schinese magicWorldEnd_1e1e5b8d:

    # magd "I believe it's some kind of message."
    magd "我想是一封信息。"

translate schinese magicWorldEnd_388f8792:

    # magd "However, I took a look at it, and I can't figure out what it's supposed to mean."
    magd "不过我看过之后，完全弄不懂它是什么意思。"

translate schinese magicWorldEnd_e1a6e5f4:

    # mc "Let me see."
    mc "给我看看。"

translate schinese magicWorldEnd_69c93a17:

    # k "What is this?"
    k "这是什么？"

translate schinese magicWorldEnd_12e57f28:

    # v "Just some random letters?"
    v "就是一堆随机的字母？"

translate schinese magicWorldEnd_91b7df50:

    # r "What the hell?"
    r "搞什么？"

translate schinese magicWorldEnd_61429a86:

    # a "It looks like some kind of... cipher. And it has the word \"Portal\" written at the bottom."
    a "看起来像是某种……密码。而且下面写着「传送门」这个词。"

translate schinese magicWorldEnd_3e1c257c:

    # magd "Exactly. I also thought of a cipher."
    magd "没错。我也觉得是某种密码。"

translate schinese magicWorldEnd_50bda7dc:

    # magd "Unfortunately, it's not any cipher I'm familiar with. And since it wasn't a message directed at me, I didn't try to dig deeper."
    magd "可惜不是我认识的任何一种。而且既然不是写给我的，我也没深究。"

translate schinese magicWorldEnd_31f19e87:

    # magd "I thought maybe you'd be able to decipher it, but judging by your faces, I was wrong."
    magd "我本以为你们能解出来，但看你们的表情，看来是我错了。"

translate schinese magicWorldEnd_07fa94f4:

    # mc "I have no idea what it could mean. What about you guys?"
    mc "我完全看不出它是什么意思。你们呢？"

translate schinese magicWorldEnd_85ea379c:

    # r "No clue."
    r "不知道。"

translate schinese magicWorldEnd_ffb1467b:

    # v "Me neither."
    v "我也不知道。"

translate schinese magicWorldEnd_14b07f73:

    # k "We should check online when we get home."
    k "回去以后我们上网查查吧。"

translate schinese magicWorldEnd_8365d45d:

    # mc "Yeah, that's the best we can do."
    mc "对，这是目前能想到最好的办法了。"

translate schinese magicWorldEnd_cd288302:

    # a "In that case, I'll handle it."
    a "那就交给我吧。"

translate schinese magicWorldEnd_c25de083:

    # mc "I was hoping you'd say that. Of our group, you'll probably be the fastest at it."
    mc "我正希望你说这句话。在我们几个人里，你大概会是最快的。"

translate schinese magicWorldEnd_80f60200:

    # a "Of course. Leave it to me."
    a "当然。包在我身上。"

translate schinese magicWorldEnd_a200687b:

    # mc "Is that everything you've got for us?"
    mc "你要给我们的就只有这些了吗？"

translate schinese magicWorldEnd_56f6f613:

    # magd "Yes. She only gave me that paper and said you would come to take it."
    magd "是的。她只给了我那张纸，说你们会来拿。"

translate schinese magicWorldEnd_050ebaad:

    # magd "Or, to be more precise, that you, [mc], would come to take it. If that changes anything."
    magd "或者更准确地说，是说你，[mc]，会来拿。不知道这算不算有区别。"

translate schinese magicWorldEnd_e4e5720d:

    # magd "After that, she vanished, and didn't tell me anything else."
    magd "之后她就消失了，什么都没再多说。"

translate schinese magicWorldEnd_30d804c2:

    # mc "Hmm, I see. That's not good. To be honest, I expected to learn more."
    mc "嗯，我明白了。这可不妙。说实话，我本来以为能打听到更多。"

translate schinese magicWorldEnd_436f9516:

    # mc "Well then, let's just hope the note gives us something once the code is cracked."
    mc "那就希望破译出密码之后，那张纸条能给我们点线索吧。"

translate schinese magicWorldEnd_c4e22dce:

    # mc "Anyway, if that's all, we'll get going. Thanks for the help."
    mc "总之，如果没别的事，我们就先走了。谢谢您的帮助。"

translate schinese magicWorldEnd_ff39275c:

    # magd "Wait!"
    magd "等等！"

translate schinese magicWorldEnd_7c927b78:

    # mc "Yes?"
    mc "什么事？"

translate schinese magicWorldEnd_130e2bbc:

    # magd "There is something I'd like to ask as well."
    magd "我也有些事想问你。"

translate schinese magicWorldEnd_d2b33678:

    # mc "Um, you want to ask me something?"
    mc "呃，你有事想问我？"

translate schinese magicWorldEnd_28a71154:

    # mc "Yes, exactly."
    mc "对，正是。"

translate schinese magicWorldEnd_5af9c6b5:

    # mc "Well, I have no idea what I could know that would interest you, but sure. I'm listening."
    mc "嗯，我不知道我能知道什么你感兴趣的事，不过没关系，我听着。"

translate schinese magicWorldEnd_329140bf:

    # magd "It's obvious that you know more about this whole situation than I do. Otherwise, you wouldn't even be here."
    magd "很明显，你对整件事的了解比我多。不然你也不会特地来这里。"

translate schinese magicWorldEnd_2e589dac:

    # magd "I won't hide it, I'm deeply concerned. I have a feeling that something much bigger is happening around me, and I have no idea about any of it."
    magd "我不隐瞒，我非常担心。我有种感觉，在我身边正发生着某种大得多的事，而我对此一无所知。"

translate schinese magicWorldEnd_1c94cdb8:

    # magd "I hate that feeling."
    magd "我讨厌这种感觉。"

translate schinese magicWorldEnd_2da26c41:

    # magd "I'd like to ask you to tell me everything you know. There must be a reason why you are looking for this woman."
    magd "所以我想请你把你知道的全都告诉我。你们要找那个女人，一定有某种理由。"

translate schinese magicWorldEnd_1a1b07dd:

    # mc "Well, actually, I don't see any reason not to."
    mc "嗯，其实我没觉得有什么不能说的。"

translate schinese magicWorldEnd_367b84b0:

    # mc "But I have to disappoint you as well. We don't actually know all that much ourselves."
    mc "但我也得让你失望。我们自己其实也只知道这么多。"

translate schinese magicWorldEnd_3d22ab05:

    # mc "Everything we've heard came from other people. We never got the chance to ask the source directly."
    mc "我们听到的一切都来自别人，从来没机会直接去问源头。"

translate schinese magicWorldEnd_6dbdcf67:

    # magd "And that source is...?"
    magd "那个源头是……？"

translate schinese magicWorldEnd_d7b54529:

    # mc "Yes. I suspect it's that woman. At least, that's what I'm hoping."
    mc "没错。我怀疑就是那个女人。至少，我是这么希望的。"

translate schinese magicWorldEnd_99e7db99:

    # magd "I see. Well, every piece of information is valuable, so I'll be grateful for anything you can tell me."
    magd "我明白了。嗯，每一条信息都有价值，你能告诉我的任何事我都很感激。"

translate schinese magicWorldEnd_6651ab87:

    # mc "Alright."
    mc "好。"

translate schinese magicWorldEnd_36e265c9:

    # "{i}You told him everything you had learned about Guardians, portals, and other worlds.{/i}"
    "{i}你把关于守护者、传送门以及其他世界的一切都告诉了他。{/i}"

translate schinese magicWorldEnd_188f40d1:

    # "{i}You explained your situation and told him why you are looking for the mysterious woman.{/i}"
    "{i}你说明了自己的处境，也告诉他你为什么要寻找那个神秘的女人。{/i}"

translate schinese magicWorldEnd_c90991af:

    # magd "I see, I see. So there are multiple different worlds, and these Guardians are supposedly their protectors who can move between them."
    magd "我明白了，我明白了。也就是说存在着好几个不同的世界，而这些守护者据说是凌驾于各个世界之上的保护者，能够在它们之间移动。"

translate schinese magicWorldEnd_78f6174c:

    # mc "Yes, and for some reason, I can do it too. I'm looking for that woman to find out why."
    mc "是的，而且不知为何，我好像也能做到。我正在找那个女人，就是想弄清楚为什么。"

translate schinese magicWorldEnd_635eb0aa:

    # magd "It is... certainly hard to believe, but it also explains a lot. Now I know why you knew nothing about our festival."
    magd "这……确实很难让人相信，但也解释了很多事。现在我明白你为什么对我们学校的节庆一无所知了。"

translate schinese magicWorldEnd_d8cc70f2:

    # magd "Very well. Considering everything I've seen, I believe you."
    magd "很好。综合我所看到的一切，我相信你。"

translate schinese magicWorldEnd_d169b88f:

    # mc "Out of curiosity, what will you do with this information?"
    mc "出于好奇，你打算怎么处理这些信息？"

translate schinese magicWorldEnd_0895bce1:

    # magd "First, I need to make some inquiries among the council members. I hope they haven't been hiding anything from me."
    magd "首先，我得在议员们之间打听一番。希望他们没有瞒着我什么。"

translate schinese magicWorldEnd_a11b0fa5:

    # magd "I might not look it, but I'm a fairly important person in this world. I'll find a way to get to the truth."
    magd "我也许看不出来，但在这个世界里我算是个重要人物。我会想办法查到真相。"

translate schinese magicWorldEnd_abbbdb94:

    # magd "Then we'll see what happens. However, news of an organization standing above all worlds isn't something I can just ignore."
    magd "到时候再看吧。不过，有一个凌驾于所有世界之上的组织存在这件事，我没法视而不见。"

translate schinese magicWorldEnd_2062bdf4:

    # mc "Can't argue with that."
    mc "这点我无法反驳。"

translate schinese magicWorldEnd_b7d0f9ec:

    # magd "Thank you for sharing what you know. If you learn anything more, please come back to me."
    magd "谢谢你愿意分享你所知道的。如果还想起了什么，请再来告诉我。"

translate schinese magicWorldEnd_9df76c97:

    # magd "And if you ever need help, you know where to find me. I'll do whatever I can."
    magd "而如果你哪天需要帮忙，你知道去哪里找我。我会尽我所能。"

translate schinese magicWorldEnd_f33b91ac:

    # mc "I will. Thanks."
    mc "我会的。谢谢。"

translate schinese magicWorldEnd_e8002c8a:

    # a "Goodbye, headmaster!"
    a "再见，校长！"

translate schinese magicWorldEnd_6595153f:

    # magd "Farewell, Alice! Good luck with the cipher and your classes with Mr. Morgrave!"
    magd "再见了，爱丽丝！祝你的密码破译顺利，也祝你在莫格雷夫先生那里上课顺利！"

translate schinese magicWorldEnd_b789bacf:

    # a "Hehe, I see you already know everything! I can't wait for them!"
    a "嘿嘿，看来您已经都知道啦！我等不及了！"

translate schinese magicWorldEnd_16b8eb99:

    # magd "Alright then, let's get to work."
    magd "那就加油吧。"

translate schinese magicWorldEnd_7ab918c6:

    # mc "I'm sorry, but I don't think I should do that."
    mc "抱歉，我觉得我不该那么做。"

translate schinese magicWorldEnd_5abd9c4c:

    # magd "And why is that?"
    magd "为什么？"

translate schinese magicWorldEnd_d65ef50e:

    # mc "First of all, I don't exactly know what the truth is myself."
    mc "首先，我自己也不真正清楚真相是什么。"

translate schinese magicWorldEnd_7508a0f5:

    # mc "My entire knowledge is based on what I've heard, and I've never reached the source."
    mc "我掌握的全部知识都来自道听途说，从没追溯到源头。"

translate schinese magicWorldEnd_889e814d:

    # magd "And the source is...?"
    magd "那个源头是……？"

translate schinese magicWorldEnd_d7b54529_1:

    # mc "Yes. I suspect it's that woman. At least, that's what I'm hoping."
    mc "没错。我怀疑就是那个女人。至少，我是这么希望的。"

translate schinese magicWorldEnd_4b24b25b:

    # mc "I simply don't want to spread information that I'm not certain about."
    mc "我实在不想传播自己都没把握的信息。"

translate schinese magicWorldEnd_51675f99:

    # mc "Secondly, judging by their actions, they choose for themselves who should know the truth and who shouldn't."
    mc "其次，从他们的所作所为来看，他们会自己决定谁该知道真相、谁不该知道。"

translate schinese magicWorldEnd_6671559f:

    # mc "I don't think they'd be happy if I suddenly started blabbing it to everyone."
    mc "我不认为他们会高兴我突然到处乱说。"

translate schinese magicWorldEnd_fb997a1e:

    # mc "That's why I won't do it, at least not until I confirm for myself that they don't mind."
    mc "所以我不会那么做，至少在我亲自确认她们不介意之前不会。"

translate schinese magicWorldEnd_a94bbbfc:

    # magd "I see. That is... disheartening."
    magd "我明白了。这……真让人沮丧。"

translate schinese magicWorldEnd_864bd442:

    # magd "I expected to learn something more, but instead, I'm left with nothing."
    magd "我本以为能知道更多，结果还是一无所获。"

translate schinese magicWorldEnd_a1682181:

    # mc "I'm sorry I couldn't help more."
    mc "抱歉，我没能帮上更多忙。"

translate schinese magicWorldEnd_c5600bc8:

    # magd "It's alright. If things are indeed as you say, then I understand your situation."
    magd "没关系。如果事情真如你所说，我理解你的处境。"

translate schinese magicWorldEnd_99fa5d7b:

    # magd "In that case, that's all I wanted to know."
    magd "那这就是我想知道的全部了。"

translate schinese magicWorldEnd_520950bb:

    # mc "We'll be heading out then. Let's go, everyone."
    mc "那我们先走了。大家一起吧。"

