    # magd "What the hell is going on here?"
    magd "这里到底是怎么回事？"

translate schinese magicWorldEnd_6948ff82:

    # ch_nvl "That was fucking rude!"
    ch_nvl "你他妈太没礼貌了！"

translate schinese magicWorldEnd_234d39f1:

    # ch_nvl "But I get it. The golden rule is the golden rule"
    ch_nvl "不过我懂。金规就是金规。"

translate schinese magicWorldEnd_ba97b91f:

    # ch_nvl "I'd do the same thing just to be alone with the girls"
    ch_nvl "换我我也一样，只要能和几个女孩子单独待着。"

translate schinese magicWorldEnd_8ddebc4c:

    # ch_nvl "Doesn't change the fact that you're a dick though"
    ch_nvl "但这不改变你是个混蛋的事实。"

translate schinese magicWorldEnd_afeb3f72:

    # ch_nvl "Luckily, I've got a secret weapon for situations like this"
    ch_nvl "好在我有个专门应付这种场合的秘密武器。"

