    # ch_nvl "I fucking hate you! You couldn't have at least sent me home?"
    ch_nvl "我他妈恨你！你就不能至少把我送回家吗？"

translate schinese magicWorldEnd_75c7a051:

    # ch_nvl "I landed in some alleyway right on top of some thug"
    ch_nvl "我掉进了一条小巷里，正好砸在一个混混身上。"

translate schinese magicWorldEnd_4f994d16:

    # ch_nvl "They took my money and tried to beat me, but I managed to escape"
    ch_nvl "他们抢了我的钱还想打我，不过我跑掉了。"

translate schinese magicWorldEnd_d9180413:

    # ch_nvl "I took a photo of them and I'm reporting it to the police"
    ch_nvl "我拍下了他们的照片，准备报警。"

