    # ch_nvl "You're a dick, but goddamn, I love you"
    ch_nvl "你是个混蛋，但该死的是，我爱你。"

translate schinese magicWorldEnd_1581415d:

    # ch_nvl "That bathhouse? A hundred times better than any magic world"
    ch_nvl "那个澡堂？比任何魔法世界都好上一百倍。"

translate schinese magicWorldEnd_56d63703:

    # ch_nvl "My god, naked beautiful bodies everywhere. Those tits, those asses! Incredible!"
    ch_nvl "我的天，到处都是赤裸的美丽身体。那些奶子，那些屁股！太绝了！"

translate schinese magicWorldEnd_d0634c33:

    # ch_nvl "Shame they kicked me out so fast, but I managed to snap a pic. Thanks for that!"
    ch_nvl "可惜他们把我赶得这么快，不过我还是抢到了一张照片。谢了啊！"

translate schinese free_day10_35f3508e:

    # mc "Good thing this trip to the magic world wasn't pointless after all. Although, I got a bit scared when old man said he didn't know that woman."
    mc "好在这趟魔法世界之行总算没白费。虽然老头子说他不认识那个女人时，我确实吓了一跳。"

translate schinese free_day10_bdf5ea7e:

    # mc "Now I just have to wait for Alice to decode the message. I hope she gets through it quickly."
    mc "现在只要等爱丽丝破译那条信息就行。希望她能快点搞定。"

translate schinese free_day10_9b236e98:

    # mc "Anyway, my hands are tied, so I need to find something to do. Maybe I'll go see someone?"
    mc "反正我现在也帮不上忙，得找点事做。要不去看看谁？"

translate schinese free_day10_8b13dc4d:

    # mc "Or maybe I'll just stay at home and fap all day."
    mc "或者干脆待在家里打一天手枪。"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_9897b25f:

    # k "Hey!"
    k "喂！"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_4e75d6ec:

    # mc "You're not the girl I'm waiting for."
    mc "你不是我等的那个人。"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_878407d3:

    # k "True. Are you disappointed or happy about that?"
    k "确实。对此你是失望还是开心？"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_44e5c6c6:

    # mc "Neither. We live together and you come up to me like that a few times a day. I'm used to it."
    mc "都不是。我们住在一起，你一天这样上来好几次，我都习惯了。"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_2f2235ad:

    # k "Jeez, you're no fun at all."
    k "天啊，你真的一点意思都没有。"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_6521657f:

    # k "Ready for your date with Alice?"
    k "准备好和爱丽丝约会了吗？"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_00bad5ea:

    # mc "Technically, it's not a date."
    mc "严格来说，这不算约会。"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_8014d92b:

    # mc "She just wants to hang out. We've done it plenty of times before and no one called it a date. She hasn't said it once, either."
    mc "她只是想一起出去逛逛。我们以前也这样做过很多次，谁都没说过这是约会。她一次也没提过。"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_498ef4cd:

    # k "Oh, please. Some things don't need to be said out loud to be true. Don't play dumb."
    k "得了吧。有些事不用说出口也是成立的。别装傻。"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_00e21d02:

    # k "So? Where are you taking her?"
    k "所以呢？你要带她去哪儿？"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_70a444bd:

    # mc "I don't know."
    mc "不知道。"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_b61c08df:

    # k "What? What do you mean you don't know?"
    k "什么？你说不知道是什么意思？"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_17c3231f:

    # k "Don't tell me you didn't plan anything?"
    k "别告诉我你什么都没计划？"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_701ad761:

    # mc "I didn't, because Alice said she'd handle it. I just had to make time."
    mc "是没计划，因为爱丽丝说她来安排。我只要腾出时间就行。"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_e9f0d3ae:

    # k "Huuuh... That's surprising. I didn't expect her to be so into it."
    k "哦……真意外。我没想到她这么上心。"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_b8638768:

    # k "Haaah... I'm jealous. I want to go on a date, too."
    k "唉……我好嫉妒。我也想去约会。"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_b13eefbc:

    # mc "Then you gotta find yourself a boyfriend to take you."
    mc "那你就得自己找个男朋友带你去。"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_f332c053:

    # k "Wanna be my boyfriend?"
    k "要不要当我男朋友？"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_2b35b6fe:

    # mc "..."
    mc "……"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_0fd8b260:

    # mc "Is that a hint that I should ask you out?"
    mc "这是在暗示我应该向你表白吗？"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_b0312f4d:

    # k "Haha, who knows."
    k "哈哈，谁知道呢。"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_e5ca1847:

    # mc "Nah, staying home is way better anyway."
    mc "不了，待在家明明更好。"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_d979f78d:

    # k "Ugh, if you're gonna say stuff like that, you're better off saying nothing. You'll ruin Alice's mood with that talk."
    k "呃，你要说这种话，干脆什么都别说更好。你会毁掉爱丽丝的心情。"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_7e4e608c:

    # mc "I won't ruin it, don't worry. I know Alice and I know how to handle her."
    mc "我不会的，别担心。我了解爱丽丝，也知道怎么应付她。"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_4e85a75c:

    # k "Mhmm, I hope so."
    k "嗯，希望如此。"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_bf575569:

    # mc "Then how about I take you out one day?"
    mc "那改天我带你出去怎么样？"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_0378a915:

    # k "You'd do that?"
    k "你愿意？"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_44d516bf:

    # mc "Sure. Hanging out with you is always fun."
    mc "当然。和你一起玩总是很开心。"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_059dfebe:

    # k "{i}*Giggles*{/i} Well, thank you."
    k "{i}*咯咯笑*{/i} 那就谢谢你啦。"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_f2fd8724:

    # k "But you shouldn't say stuff like that right before a date with another girl."
    k "不过在和别的女孩约会之前，你不该说这种话。"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_2acbdc07:

    # k "Just focus on her."
    k "专心在她身上。"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_9c7d3c83:

    # mc "Then why don't you just invite someone?"
    mc "那你干脆自己约个人不就行了？"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_d62ec644:

    # k "I'd rather someone invite me."
    k "我更希望别人来约我。"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_13d1b137:

    # mc "Scared to make the first move?"
    mc "不敢先出手？"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_a912f6b8:

    # k "No, I just think it's more romantic that way."
    k "没有，我只是觉得那样更浪漫一点。"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_0e1b076a:

    # mc "Hah, you have no clue what romance even is."
    mc "哈，你根本不懂什么叫浪漫。"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_9c1ba874:

    # k "Says the expert."
    k "这话从专家嘴里说出来可真够行的。"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_17a1bcf0:

    # a "{size=*1.4}One more minute, [mc]!"
    a "{size=*1.4}再等一分钟，[mc]！"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_d046fe3d:

    # mc "{size=*1.4}Sure, take your time!"
    mc "{size=*1.4}好，慢慢来！"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_fe8b1b3d:

    # k "Looks like she's almost ready. I'm gonna head out then."
    k "看起来她快好了。那我先出门了。"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_ae76b991:

    # mc "Where are you going?"
    mc "你去哪儿？"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_c6318a85:

    # k "To the gym."
    k "去健身房。"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_ecfc3b38:

    # mc "Again? Weren't you there yesterday?"
    mc "又去？你昨天不是才去过吗？"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_002ef130:

    # k "Mom asked me to go with her. She wanted me to show her a few exercises."
    k "妈妈让我陪她一起去。她想让我教她几个动作。"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_53059308:

    # mc "Aw, damn. If I were free, I'd totally go with you guys."
    mc "啊，可恶。要是我有空，肯定跟你们一起去。"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_2960c7b0:

    # k "Ewww, perv."
    k "咦——变态。"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_30971c8e:

    # mc "What? Why?!"
    mc "什么？！为什么？！"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_0b156de8:

    # k "You'd only come along to check out our butts."
    k "你跟着去肯定只是为了看我们的屁股。"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_82d26730:

    # mc "That's... partially true, but not just that."
    mc "这……有一部分说对了，但不完全是。"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_c4b33347:

    # k "I can send you a picture if you want."
    k "你要的话我可以发照片给你。"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_58ec6b5f:

    # k "What do you say? Want it? Want it?"
    k "怎么样？要不要？要不要？"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_e2c407cb:

    # k "I know you do."
    k "我就知道你要。"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_2f068911:

    # mc "I do."
    mc "要。"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_6340975a:

    # k "Hahaha, point for honesty!"
    k "哈哈哈，诚实加分！"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_fad5b26a:

    # k "I'm off. Have fun!"
    k "我走啦，玩得开心！"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_c2c12c08:

    # mc "Thanks, you too."
    mc "你也是。"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_ff160a97:

    # a "Haaah! I'm coming!"
    a "哈啊——我来啦！"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_9d20e7f4:

    # a "Sorry you had to wait. Had a little trouble with my hair, but it's all good now."
    a "抱歉让你等了。头发刚才有点小麻烦，不过现在都弄好了。"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_e460438a:

    # mc "(Ohh, damn...)"
    mc "（哦哦，该死……）"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_e4dde0d8:

    # mc "(I shouldn't stare too much. She'll get mad at me.)"
    mc "（我不能盯着看太久。她会生气的。）"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_a2f4eb7f:

    # mc "Don't worry about it. The show on TV was actually pretty interesting, so the time flew by."
    mc "没事。电视上的节目其实挺有意思的，时间一下就过去了。"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_ef85c08c:

    # a "Good."
    a "是吗。"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_8c56d8d6:

    # mc "It was worth the wait. Your hair looks amazing."
    mc "没白等。你的头发真好看。"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_3e2e7a91:

    # a "O-Oh..."
    a "哦、哦……"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_1929d48a:

    # a "Thank you. I'm happy you like it."
    a "谢谢。你喜欢我很高兴。"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_2687eae5:

    # mc "No problem. Kate sat with me for a bit, so I wasn't bored."
    mc "不客气。凯特刚才陪了我一会儿，所以也没无聊。"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_f96496fa:

    # a "Kate? Wasn't she going to the gym?"
    a "凯特？她不是去健身房了吗？"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_7c44a9b8:

    # mc "She left literally seconds before you came down."
    mc "你下来之前她正好走了，也就差了几秒钟。"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_7d4bb7ca:

    # a "Oh, okay."
    a "哦，好吧。"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_a554ed2b:

    # mc "So? Why'd you tell me to dress like that?"
    mc "话说回来，你为什么让我打扮成这样？"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_f2d3f77e:

    # mc "I doubt we're going to play sports. That's the last thing I'd expect from you. What's the plan?"
    mc "我不觉得我们要去运动。那是我最不可能从你身上期待的事。到底什么计划？"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_2398de85:

    # a "Hehe, no, it's not sports, but we'll be moving around a bit today."
    a "嘿嘿，不是运动，不过今天我们会到处跑一跑。"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_f87ef751:

    # a "I've got a genius idea. We're going to another world."
    a "我有个绝妙的主意。我们要去另一个世界。"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_24774b70:

    # mc "Sure, very funny, Alice."
    mc "好的，非常有趣，爱丽丝。"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_294bdda0:

    # mc "But for real, what's the actual plan?"
    mc "说真的，到底是什么计划？"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_71ea495d:

    # a "I'm not kidding."
    a "我没开玩笑。"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_59ae69e8:

    # mc "Wait... seriously?"
    mc "等等……真的假的？"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_3fe6925e:

    # a "Yes! Since we have the chance, we should take it, don't you think?"
    a "真的！既然有机会，不好好利用一下吗？"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_14b00e16:

    # a "There are cool places here too, but another world is a completely different ball game."
    a "这里也有好玩的地方，但另一个世界完全是两码事。"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_b00f6367:

    # mc "Well, it's hard to argue with that."
    mc "嗯，这话我还真没法反驳。"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_3c6f436e:

    # mc "What world specifically do you have in mind?"
    mc "你具体想去哪个世界？"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_01838c4c:

    # a "Okay, focus!"
    a "好，注意力集中！"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_4a4db7b6:

    # a "Today, I want to become an {i}adventurer{/i}. I'm sure you know what I mean."
    a "今天，我要当一名{i}冒险者{/i}。我肯定知道你的意思。"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_fd30c44e:

    # a "Fantasy world, powerful heroes, monstrous beasts, demon kings, quests, fighting, swords, magic. That kind of stuff."
    a "幻想世界、强大的英雄、巨型怪物、魔王、任务、战斗、剑、魔法。之类的东西。"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_221033de:

    # a "Let's go visit a world like that. I want to see it with my own eyes."
    a "我们去一个那样的世界看看。我想亲眼见识一下。"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_f7bc6319:

    # a "Walk into a tavern full of strong adventurers chugging beer after a tough day, or gearing up for a big quest."
    a "走进挤满了喝啤酒的强劲冒险者的酒馆，他们刚打完硬仗；或者为一场大任务整装待发。"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_3002e21e:

    # a "Grab a sword and slash some monster. Earn money and spend it on a hot meal!"
    a "抄起剑砍几只怪物。挣到钱，再拿去吃顿热乎的饭！"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_7b14dd02:

    # a "You know what I'm talking about, right? Like a DnD world or an RPG game."
    a "你懂我在说什么吧？就像龙与地下城的世界，或者 RPG 游戏那样。"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_f122e486:

    # mc "Err, no clue what DnD is, but I think I get the vibe."
    mc "呃，我不太懂龙与地下城是什么，但我大概明白那个感觉了。"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_3a38ec38:

    # a "Great! So that's exactly the kind of world I want to go to."
    a "太好了！所以那正是我想去的世界。"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_66498166:

    # mc "(So much for a date, Kate. She just wants to play a game in real life.)"
    mc "（约会什么的果然还是不行啊，凯特。她只是想把这个游戏搬到现实里玩而已。）"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_dc6d1345:

    # mc "Hold on a sec, Alice. Don't you think it's a bit dangerous? No, wait. Not just a bit, but like, extremely?"
    mc "等一下，爱丽丝。你不觉得这样有点危险吗？不对，不只是有点，是非常危险？"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_d776c8bd:

    # mc "Fighting, magic, monsters, demons? We could die doing that."
    mc "战斗、魔法、怪物、恶魔？搞不好我们会死。"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_8345a31c:

    # mc "I really don't want to sound like Vanessa, but I also don't want anything to happen to you."
    mc "我真的不想说得像瓦妮莎那样，但我也不想你出任何事。"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_8462db1f:

    # a "If I'd suggested this while Mom was around, she would've said no immediately. That's why I only said it now that it's just the two of us."
    a "如果妈妈在的时候我说这个，她肯定会一口回绝。所以我才等到只剩我们两个的时候才说。"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_334ef288:

    # mc "Doing something like this behind her back? Some daughter you are."
    mc "背着她搞这种事？你可真是好女儿。"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_af17aa76:

    # a "Just to be clear, I don't want to go and fight demons. I'm more interested in seeing it all. You know, from a safe distance."
    a "先说清楚，我不是想去打恶魔。我只是想看看那些场面。你懂的，保持安全距离。"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_a522bbc3:

    # mc "Mhmmm? Really?"
    mc "嗯嗯？真的吗？"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_0495307a:

    # a "Well, okay, maybe I'd grab a sword and try to kill some super weak enemy. A slime or something."
    a "嗯，好吧，也许我会抄起剑试着砍几只超级弱的敌人。史莱姆之类的。"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_fca4fbdd:

    # a "But other than that, nothing too crazy."
    a "但除此之外，就不会太疯狂了。"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_25717721:

    # mc "Hmmm, I don't know."
    mc "唔，我不太确定。"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_f78e69dc:

    # a "Come on, you'll be with me."
    a "拜托，有我在你身边啊。"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_75ae2f39:

    # a "You're strong and you know how to fight. You can always open a portal, too."
    a "你又强，又会打架。而且你随时都能开传送门。"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_87309c62:

    # a "I... I really feel safe with you."
    a "我……我真的觉得和你在一起很安心。"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_e01ebd2a:

    # a "And I want to spend this time with you. Just the two of us."
    a "而且我想和你一起度过这段时光。只有我们两个人。"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_039030c1:

    # mc "(Okay, I take back what I said.)"
    mc "（好吧，我收回刚才的话。）"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_33c808a6:

    # mc "(Maybe she does see it as a date. A weird one, but still.)"
    mc "（也许她真的把这当成约会了。虽然是个奇怪的约会。）"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_e69f9eed:

    # mc "Godness... I can't really say no to you after you used such a solid argument."
    mc "天啊……你用这么充分的理由说出口，我实在没法拒绝。"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_f5c8d33a:

    # a "Yes!"
    a "耶！"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_600c7066:

    # mc "Looks like you found my weak spot, Alice. Just compliment me and you've got me in the palm of your hand."
    mc "看来你找到我的弱点了，爱丽丝。夸我一句就能把我牢牢攥在手里。"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_86f157a5:

    # a "Oh, in that case... I really like your smile. I think it's cute."
    a "哦，既然这样……我真的很喜欢你的笑容。我觉得很可爱。"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_1d82a7e7:

    # mc "...!"
    mc "……！"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_1208659b:

    # mc "{sc=1}(Ugh, damn it! I was just kidding, but maybe it really is my weak spot.)"
    mc "{sc=1}（呃，该死！我明明只是开玩笑，但说不定那真的是我的弱点。）"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_59547637:

    # a "[mc]?"
    a "[mc]？"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_4da46ce6:

    # mc "Ahem! Thanks, Alice."
    mc "咳！谢谢你，爱丽丝。"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_449324cd:

    # mc "Alright then, one fantasy world with demons, fighting, and magic, RPG style."
    mc "那就 RPG 风格，来一个带恶魔、战斗和魔法的幻想世界。"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_5b6ab294:

    # mc "Coming right up."
    mc "马上安排。"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_7ee54e25:

    # a "Umm, why'd you make it on the floor?"
    a "呃，你为什么开在地板上？"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_fd8af675:

    # mc "This way we can literally {i}jump into adventure{/i} instead of just walking in. Get it?"
    mc "这样我们就能字面意义上{i}跳进冒险{/i}，而不是走进去。懂了吗？"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_318da3b3:

    # mc "I just thought it'd be more poetic that way."
    mc "我只是觉得这样更有诗意。"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_b1564ae2:

    # a "{i}*Giggles*{/i} That's so silly."
    a "{i}*咯咯笑*{/i} 真傻。"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_f569c90b:

    # mc "Want to jump princess-style?"
    mc "想用公主的方式跳吗？"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_42e1b15d:

    # a "P-Princess-style?"
    a "公、公主的方式？"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_0d91eae4:

    # a "N-No. There's no need. I can do it myself."
    a "不、不用了。没必要。我自己能跳。"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_7af32753:

    # mc "Come on, don't be shy. I know you want it."
    mc "来嘛，别害羞。我知道你想要。"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_bb8e4b4e:

    # a "..."
    a "……"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_7fa5a70a:

    # mc "This is your last chance."
    mc "这是最后的机会了。"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_d9512dd7:

    # a "Mmmmm..."
    a "唔嗯……"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_6ec67a4e:

    # a "Okay! I-I want it!"
    a "好吧！我、我要！"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_cba638d2:

    # mc "As you wish, my lady."
    mc "如您所愿，我的女士。"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_bb8e4b4e_1:

    # a "..."
    a "……"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_48bc7e6d:

    # a "What the fuck?"
    a "搞什么？"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_3d1ee732:

    # a "As far as I know, princess-style looks a bit different."
    a "据我所知，公主的方式看起来不太是这样。"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_03fe0f02:

    # a "This is more like sack-of-potatoes style."
    a "这更像是扛麻袋的方式。"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_889888e4:

    # mc "This is carrying a sack of potatoes princess-style. Except I'm the princess and you're the sack."
    mc "这是用扛麻袋的方式扛麻袋。只不过我是公主，你是麻袋。"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_d2cfa1cc:

    # a "I'm literally speechless."
    a "我真是彻底无语了。"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_81c30cdb:

    # a "Put me down, [mc]."
    a "放我下来，[mc]。"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_568678f0:

    # mc "Forget it. We're jumping into adventure!"
    mc "算了。我们跳进冒险吧！"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_8f5259f1:

    # a "No, I'm serious. Just-{p=0.8}{nw}"
    a "不，我是认真的。先——{p=0.8}{nw}"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_20061c51:

    # a "{sc=1}AAAAAAAAAAAAAA!"
    a "{sc=1}啊啊啊啊啊啊啊——！"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_cfdc9b9a:

    # dem "Alright, I think I've done everything I needed to do for today."
    dem "好了，我觉得今天该做的事都做完了。"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_98ea96bc:

    # dem "This morning, I met with the Lizardfolk leader and signed a treaty to return some of the lands they lost 50 years ago."
    dem "今天上午，我与蜥蜴人首领会面，签署了条约，归还他们五十年前失去的部分土地。"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_e0f1a560:

    # dem "At noon, I had tea and cookies with the Nymph Council. I hate doing that, but they're too powerful to ignore."
    dem "中午，我和宁芙议会喝了茶、吃了饼干。我讨厌这种场合，但他们势力大得不能无视。"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_83da77d6:

    # dem "At least they make good pastries. Way better than whatever Elaris bakes."
    dem "不过他们的点心确实很好吃。比埃拉里斯烤的任何东西都强多了。"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_32fbc558:

    # dem "Hmmm, maybe I should ban her from the kitchen? Sometimes I feel like she's actually trying to poison me."
    dem "唔嗯，也许我该禁止她进厨房？有时候我觉得她其实是想毒死我。"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_d5457770:

    # dem "Whatever. Back to the recap."
    dem "算了。回到正题。"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_2b4ddf48:

    # dem "After the council meeting, I checked the barrier. It's still holding strong, so no need to worry about uninvited guests."
    dem "议会开完会之后，我去检查了结界。它依然很稳固，所以不用担心有不请自来的客人。"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_f4eec003:

    # dem "Then I came home and took a solid hour nap. Otherwise I wouldn't be able to function like a normal demon."
    dem "然后我回家好好睡了一个小时。不然我没法像个正常的恶魔一样活动。"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_cd102ac8:

    # dem "When I woke up, I went for a quick jog. Even as the demon lord, I've gotta stay in shape. It's important."
    dem "醒来之后，我去慢跑了一圈。就算身为魔王，我也得保持体形。这很重要。"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_4dc8cc7a:

    # dem "Came back, showered, and here I am."
    dem "跑回来，洗了个澡，然后就是现在这样。"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_004e3697:

    # dem "Technically, that's it. The rest of the day should be free... but I feel like I'm forgetting something."
    dem "严格来说就这些。今天剩下的时间应该都空着……但总觉得忘了什么事。"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_1ac39487:

    # dem "What was it, though?"
    dem "是什么呢？"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_7a9e1396:

    # dem "Hmmmm..."
    dem "唔嗯……"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_29b23103:

    # dem "..."
    dem "……"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_bbab423f:

    # dem "Oh, right!"
    dem "哦，对！"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_545f1034:

    # dem "I was supposed to take out the trash!"
    dem "我本来该去倒垃圾的！"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_ae0c9c84:

    # dem "Huh...?{p=0.5}{nw}"
    dem "哈？……{p=0.5}{nw}"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_eb7f55bf:

    # a "{sc=3}{size=*1.5}Aaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaah!{p=0.5}{nw}"
    a "{sc=3}{size=*1.5}啊啊啊啊啊——！{p=0.5}{nw}"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_e16344af:

    # a "Ouch."
    a "好痛。"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_ecf93c34:

    # mc "Ugh... Sorry, I thought the jump would be a bit less painful."
    mc "呃……抱歉，我以为跳跃不会那么疼。"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_7f12e133:

    # mc "At least we landed on something soft. Could've been worse."
    mc "至少我们落在软的东西上了。换个地方可能更糟。"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_09db9eaf:

    # a "Huh?"
    a "哈？"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_cf54cce0:

    # a "Hey, this doesn't look like a town. Where are we?"
    a "喂，这看起来不像城镇。我们在哪儿？"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_c4780984:

    # mc "Can you get off me first? Please?"
    mc "能先从我身上下来吗？拜托？"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_98b476c7:

    # a "Oh, right. Sorry."
    a "哦，对。抱歉。"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_a8fcbbfd:

    # mc "Ugh, I really need to work on my landing when I open portals on the floor."
    mc "呃，我真得练练在地板上开传送门时的着陆方式。"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_48dd31e9:

    # a "You could just create it the normal way. What's the point of doing it on the floor?"
    a "你照常开不就行了。开在地板上有什么意义？"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_4d3655ed:

    # mc "It's a good way to dodge something quickly. That's exactly what the Guardian did in the arena during the fight."
    mc "这是快速躲开攻击的好办法。那位守护者在竞技场里就是这么干的。"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_de74d1e7:

    # a "Oh, yeah. I didn't think of that."
    a "哦，对哦。我没想到这个。"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_367f2151:

    # mc "Alright, so where are we? I thought we'd land in some town."
    mc "那我们到底在哪儿？我还以为会落在某个城镇里。"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_4ad4c056:

    # a "Yeah, me too-{p=0.6}{nw}"
    a "对，我也是——{p=0.6}{nw}"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_cbd7ceb0:

    # a "{sc=1}Aaaaaaah!"
    a "{sc=1}啊啊啊——！"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_11455b53:

    # mc "What?"
    mc "什么？"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_70d3bce8:

    # mc "{sc=1}Waaah!"
    mc "{sc=1}哇啊！"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_77f52077:

    # mc "What the fuck? What is this thing?"
    mc "搞什么？这东西是什么？"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_0709f92d:

    # a "I-I don't know."
    a "我、我不知道。"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_9bb92aad:

    # mc "Oh shit! That's why the landing was soft. We fell on this thing."
    mc "我勒个去！难怪着陆是软的。我们砸在这东西身上了。"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_1496af8c:

    # mc "Looks like some kind of monster. But it's not moving. Maybe we knocked it out when we landed on its head."
    mc "看起来是某种怪物。但它不动了。也许我们砸到它脑袋，把它砸晕了。"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_32380d34:

    # a "Ugh, it looks disgusting."
    a "呃，看起来好恶心。"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_9625489f:

    # a "Why did you bring us here? I know I said monsters and demons, but I thought we'd start somewhere nicer."
    a "你为什么带我们来这种地方？我虽然说过怪物和恶魔，但我以为我们会更文明一点。"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_19a0f969:

    # mc "I told you, it's not perfect. As long as I don't know what a place looks like, I can't make the portal land exactly there."
    mc "我说了，不一定完美。只要我不知道一个地方长什么样，传送门就没法正好落在那儿。"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_66a242fe:

    # mc "When I'm just thinking {i}fantasy world{/i} the landing spot is pretty random."
    mc "当我脑子里只是想着{i}幻想世界{/i}的时候，落点相当随机。"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_db39c298:

    # mc "Thinking back, it's a good thing the portal didn't open over a volcano or something."
    mc "现在回头想想，还好传送门没开在火山口之类的上面。"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_e21fd154:

    # a "Don't even scare me like that."
    a "别用这种话吓我。"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_52ccdc41:

    # a "Anyway, what now? Should we-?{p=1}{nw}"
    a "话说，接下来怎么办？我们是不是——{p=1}{nw}"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_237e5ae1:

    # a "What's that? Sounds like foosteps."
    a "那是什么？听起来像脚步声。"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_a8403777:

    # mc "Someone's coming. From that way."
    mc "有人来了。从那个方向。"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_146edd2f:

    # mc "Get behind me."
    mc "躲到我后面。"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_78862425:

    # a "O-Okay."
    a "好、好的。"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_1c8dcfa6:

    # a "Do you see anything?"
    a "你看到什么了吗？"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_168d5226:

    # mc "No, it's-{p=0.5}{nw}"
    mc "没有，它——{p=0.5}{nw}"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_0bdbc431:

    # mc "Wait! I think I see..."
    mc "等等！我好像看到了……"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_b78aba00:

    # mc "{sc=2}{size=*1.3}Holy fuck!"
    mc "{sc=2}{size=*1.3}我天！"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_29b23103_1:

    # dem "..."
    dem "……"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_ba52f080:

    # mc "Wh-Who are you?"
    mc "你、你们是谁？"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_866ced4e:

    # "{i}She looked at the demon's body on the floor.{/i}"
    "{i}她看着躺在地上的恶魔的身体。{/i}"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_0b929918:

    # dem "Is this your doing?"
    dem "这是你们干的吗？"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_55971b5e:

    # mc "Yeah. This was our doing. Mine, to be more precise."
    mc "对。这是我们干的。准确地说，是我。"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_d78a5e8c:

    # dem "I see."
    dem "我明白了。"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_ca32de42:

    # mc "N-No. He was already lying on the floor when we arrived."
    mc "不、不是。我们到的时候他已经躺在地上了。"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_3d398a58:

    # dem "Liar."
    dem "骗子。"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_6a1a3249:

    # mc "Wha-?!"
    mc "什——？！"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_42e89e17:

    # dem "Your heart skipped a beat the moment you said \"no\". I can sense it."
    dem "你说『不』的那一刻心跳漏了一拍。我感觉得到。"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_2b35b6fe_1:

    # mc "..."
    mc "……"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_57b0b146:

    # dem "Oh, this is interesting."
    dem "哦，这就有意思了。"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_9c258694:

    # dem "A snapped neck. He's dead."
    dem "脖子被拧断了。他死了。"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_a8390419:

    # mc "He's what...?!"
    mc "他死……什么？！"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_f702c5f4:

    # dem "He must have deactivated his protection magic. Probably too relaxed, and you caught him off guard."
    dem "他一定是关掉了自己的防护魔法。多半是太放松了，被你打了个措手不及。"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_cb9a5387:

    # dem "So this is it, huh? After all these years together, this is how you end?"
    dem "所以就是这样，是吧？相处这么多年，最后就落得这种结局？"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_4d01c4b1:

    # a "{i}*Whispering*{/i} I don't like this, [mc]."
    a "{i}*低声说*{/i} 我不喜欢这样，[mc]。"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_c8a0f1f1:

    # mc "{i}*Whispering*{/i} Yeah, me neither. We should probably get out of here."
    mc "{i}*低声说*{/i} 我也是。我们大概该离开这里。"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_16140cb2:

    # dem "{sc=2}{size=*1.2}Ahahahahahahahahaha!"
    dem "{sc=2}{size=*1.2}哈哈哈哈哈哈哈哈哈！"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_05500ff6:

    # mc "Huh?"
    mc "哈？"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_d18225ec:

    # a "Why is she...?"
    a "她为什么……？"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_ad2a63d2:

    # dem "Hahahaha, by Mother Lilith!"
    dem "哈哈哈哈哈，以莉莉丝圣母起誓！"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_e1dd05a9:

    # dem "Finally! I've been waiting so long for this day! I'm finally free of you!"
    dem "终于！我等这一天等了太久了！我终于自由了！"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_391e73ca:

    # dem "You were the absolute worst! In the 1400 years I've been looking after this castle, there's never been a worse demon lord!"
    dem "你简直是最糟糕的！我照看这座城堡一千四百年，从来没有这么差的魔王！"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_0bf64661:

    # dem "You cowardly little bitch! You never once went out to fight. All you did was talk and sign your stupid treaties!"
    dem "你这个懦弱的小婊子！你一次都没出去打过仗。你干的就只有动嘴皮子和签你那些蠢条约！"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_3e781d56:

    # dem "Our kingdom became so pathetic because of you, so weak. It's never been this bad."
    dem "我们的王国因为你变得如此可悲、如此软弱。从没这么糟过。"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_eef38864:

    # dem "But it's over! It's finally over!"
    dem "但都结束了！终于结束了！"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_ff2376c1:

    # dem "Your reign is done! Things will only get better from here!"
    dem "你的统治完蛋了！往后只会越来越好！"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_e9413b0b:

    # dem "Or at least I hope so!"
    dem "至少我希望如此！"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_9eb16860:

    # dem "Ahem! Please, forgive my behavior."
    dem "咳咳！请原谅我的失态。"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_cc807a03:

    # dem "I got carried away by emotions that have been bottled up for far too long."
    dem "我被憋了太久的情绪冲昏了头。"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_1dabc2d5:

    # dem "It won't happen again, my Lord."
    dem "不会再有下次了，我的陛下。"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_0440eab4:

    # mc "My...?!"
    mc "我的……？！"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_6ee963ac:

    # a "...Lord?!"
    a "……陛下？！"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_3d809483:

    # dem "Is something wrong?"
    dem "有什么问题吗？"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_d710ea0d:

    # mc "What do you mean by \"Lord\"?"
    mc "你说的『陛下』是什么意思？"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_ce6581a8:

    # dem "I'm not sure I follow your question."
    dem "我不太明白您的问题。"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_39cc1943:

    # dem "You defeated the demon lord, so now you take his place. That means everything here, including me, is under your rule."
    dem "您打败了魔王，所以现在由您继位。这意味着这里的一切，包括我，都在您的统治之下。"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_63365726:

    # dem "I addressed every demon lord as \"my Lord\". I can call you something else if that is your wish. Just say the word."
    dem "我对每一位魔王都称呼『我的陛下』。如果您愿意，我可以换个称呼。只需一句话。"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_dabbb512:

    # mc "Errr..."
    mc "呃……"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_c093a7bd:

    # mc "I don't think I-{p=1}{nw}"
    mc "我不认为我——{p=1}{nw}"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_15b59a93:

    # a "Oh shit! So it's like... like we skipped all the starter levels and ended up in the final location with the final boss."
    a "我勒个去！所以这就好像……我们跳过了所有前期关卡，直接冲到了最终地点面对最终头目。"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_c54be92d:

    # a "What's more, we took him out in one hit."
    a "而且我们还是一击就把他干掉了。"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_1972dd27:

    # a "Hahah, oh god! This is almost like cheating."
    a "哈哈，天啊！这简直跟作弊没什么区别。"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_867b57df:

    # mc "So what? I'm some kind of king in charge of all the demons now?"
    mc "所以呢？我现在成了统领所有恶魔的某种国王？"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_39dbee51:

    # dem "Exactly. The entire kingdom is now under your command."
    dem "正是。整个王国现在都听命于您。"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_9dd000e7:

    # mc "But... But I never wanted to be a demon lord."
    mc "可是……可是我从没想过要当魔王。"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_e33cb630:

    # dem "A demon lord can only lose his position through death. You can be defeated in battle, or take your own life."
    dem "魔王只有通过死亡才能失去这个位置。您可以战死，也可以自尽。"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_2b35b6fe_2:

    # mc "..."
    mc "……"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_93347dd1:

    # mc "Okay... Yeah, I'd rather just be lord then."
    mc "好吧……既然如此，那我还是当陛下好了。"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_74a6967c:

    # mc "{i}*Sigh...*{/i} This isn't how it was supposed to go. Sorry, Alice."
    mc "{i}*叹气……*{/i} 事情不该是这样的。抱歉，爱丽丝。"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_a02bcbd0:

    # mc "Maybe we should just head back and try again? You know, find some other world?"
    mc "要不我们干脆回去，换一个世界再试试？找个别的世界？"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_600f1889:

    # a "No way! Come on, this could be cool too. Everyone loves a good villain arc."
    a "想都别想！说不定这边也很有意思。大家都喜欢当反派嘛。"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_68b95b19:

    # mc "But I'm not a villain."
    mc "但我不是反派。"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_e92771cc:

    # a "So, what can we do as the demon lord?"
    a "那我们作为魔王能做些什么？"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_8d0537d8:

    # dem "Excuse me, but who exactly are you?"
    dem "打扰一下，请问您究竟是哪位？"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_21b3e9c3:

    # a "Me? Ummm..."
    a "我？呃……"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_191690e7:

    # mc "She's my right-hand woman. Without her, I wouldn't have been able to... take down the previous lord."
    mc "她是我的左膀右臂。没有她，我也不可能……打倒上一任陛下。"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_7b974b51:

    # dem "I see. In that case, I shall address you with due respect, milady."
    dem "我明白了。既然如此，我将以应有的敬称称呼您，女士。"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_bc9d06e9:

    # dem "To answer your question, the demon lord can do whatever his heart desires."
    dem "回答您的问题，魔王可以做任何他心中所想之事。"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_3683f4b3:

    # a "Oh, right. That makes sense. Though I can imagine that getting a bit boring after a while."
    a "哦，对。这样说得通。不过我想象中的话，日子久了大概会有点无聊。"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_01b1abd3:

    # mc "Wait, can we just start with the basics? Who even are you?"
    mc "等等，我们能不能从最基础的开始？你到底是谁？"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_31620de1:

    # ela "My name is Elaris. I am a succubus, and I've looked after this castle since the day it was built. I also serve and assist every demon lord."
    ela "我叫埃拉里斯。我是一名魅魔，自这座城堡建成之日起就一直照看它。我同时侍奉并辅佐每一位魔王。"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_dd5f1bb6:

    # mc "Okay. But if you serve the demon lord, why were you just kicking his body and celebrating his death a second ago?"
    mc "好吧。可既然你侍奉魔王，刚才为什么要踢他的身体、庆祝他的死？"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_e623163c:

    # mc "Shouldn't you be, I don't know, sad that your ruler is dead?"
    mc "你的君主死了，你不觉得……该伤心吗？"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_8a51acd1:

    # ela "He was a weak ruler, I won't miss him. Besides, his decisions made my life a living hell, hence my joy."
    ela "他是个软弱的统治者，我不会怀念他。何况是他的决定让我活得水深火热，我才这么开心。"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_416270a3:

    # mc "What kind of decisions?"
    mc "什么样的决定？"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_4c5e11c2:

    # ela "I see that somehow, you're completely clueless. Very well, I shall explain everything from the beginning."
    ela "我看你是完全搞不清楚状况呢。好吧，我就从头解释一遍。"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_398c87a7:

    # ela "Succubi." with dis5
    ela "魅魔。" with dis5

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_897088ef:

    # ela "Everyone in this world knows that we, succubi, draw energy from male seed. It is what makes us powerful."
    ela "这世上人人都知道，我们魅魔从男性的精华中汲取能量。正是这让我们强大。"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_27ff7bcf:

    # ela "Since time immemorial, we hunted men, drained them, and then killed them."
    ela "自古以来，我们猎杀男人、吸干他们，然后杀掉他们。"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_f6255bcf:

    # ela "Killing isn't strictly necessary, but it's like a dessert. There's nothing better than sweet blood after a hearty meal."
    ela "杀人其实并非必要，但那就相当于餐后甜点。饱餐之后，再没有比甘美的鲜血更美好的东西了。"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_bb69c5c2:

    # ela "I am the oldest and most powerful succubus alive."
    ela "我是现存最年长、也是最强的魅魔。"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_2b848366:

    # ela "Over the years, I have killed thousands of men, draining them dry."
    ela "这些年来，我杀过成千上万的男人，把他们吸得一干二净。"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_f5fce08d:

    # ela "I was proud of the magical energy I managed to amass. Everyone trembled before my power. Everyone knew name Elaris."
    ela "我为自己积攒的魔法能量而自豪。所有人都对我的力量战栗，所有人都知道埃拉里斯这个名字。"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_64bb8c6b:

    # ela "But it didn't last forever."
    ela "但那没能持续太久。"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_e50f9249:

    # ela "That's when {i}he{/i} appeared. The new demon lord."
    ela "那时{i}他{/i}出现了。新任魔王。"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_e1e40e53:

    # ela "With his arrival, everything changed."
    ela "随着他的到来，一切都变了。"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_9a18b342:

    # ela "He easily defeated the former lord. At first, I thought he was powerful... but I was wrong. His whole plan was to bring in an era of peace."
    ela "他轻松击败了前任陛下。一开始我以为他很强……但我错了。他整个计划就是开启一个和平的时代。"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_c9a0bd97:

    # ela "He was weak. He forbade me from hunting living men. Instead, I was only allowed to feed on corpses."
    ela "他很弱。他禁止我猎杀活着的男人，只准我吸食尸体。"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_219438f5:

    # ela "He claimed that killing without reason was wrong. Because of him, I became significantly weaker."
    ela "他声称无理由的杀戮是错误的。因为他，我衰弱了不少。"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_02a66981:

    # ela "But it wasn't just me. A wave of weakness washed over the entire kingdom. Now, everyone just loves each other and lives in peace."
    ela "但不只是我。整个王国都被一阵虚弱席卷。现在人人相爱，和平共处。"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_b2e507e4:

    # ela "We only fight other nations if they try to harm us. Otherwise, we avoid conflict at all costs."
    ela "只有在别国试图伤害我们时我们才开战。否则我们不惜一切代价避免冲突。"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_f71a9030:

    # ela "To make things worse, every demon lord before him satisfied my bedroom needs. When I couldn't find a suitable man, they would take care of me."
    ela "更糟的是，他之前的每一位魔王都会满足我的床上需求。我找不到合适的男人时，他们就会来照顾我。"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_fc920389:

    # ela "They provided me with some energy and, more importantly, much-needed pleasure."
    ela "他们给我一些能量，更重要的是，给了我急需的快感。"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_27f5e1b3:

    # ela "But him... he refused every single time, no matter how hard I tried to seduce him."
    ela "但他……不管我怎么诱惑，他每一次都拒绝了。"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_197fbad3:

    # ela "I have no idea what was wrong with him. But the fact remains, I never sensed even a hint of arousal from him."
    ela "我完全不知道他哪里有问题。但事实就是，我从没在他身上感觉到一丝一毫的欲望。"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_dcd336fa:

    # ela "To be honest, I don't really care what happens to the kingdom. It can stay weak, or even fall for all I care."
    ela "说实话，王国变成怎样我根本不在乎。它继续虚弱下去，甚至就此毁灭都无所谓。"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_5a4ebf53:

    # ela "But the fact that he forbade me from hunting, and wouldn't even fuck me himself... it drove me absolutely insane."
    ela "但他禁止我狩猎，连亲自操我都不肯……这简直把我逼疯了。"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_9bd5ae7f:

    # ela "I hated him. I hated him with all my heart!"
    ela "我恨他。我恨他恨到骨子里！"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_ca85694f:

    # mc "D-Damn, that's... that's horrible. I... I don't even know what to say."
    mc "该、该死，这……这太惨了。我……我都不知道该说什么。"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_ae39020f:

    # mc "Sound like had a really, really rough time."
    mc "听起来他这段时间真的、真的过得很苦。"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_d0bf089c:

    # ela "I did. But luckily, we have a new demon lord now."
    ela "是的。不过好在我们现在有了新的魔王。"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_da95b916:

    # ela "I hope you will restore order to the kingdom."
    ela "我希望您能重振王国的秩序。"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_cff05be4:

    # ela "Though the only thing I truly care about is that you find at least a little time for me."
    ela "不过我真正在意的只有一件事：您能给我留出一点时间。"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_2a99371c:

    # ela "{bt=1}After so many dry years I really, really need it, {i}my lord{/i}."
    ela "{bt=1}干涸了这么多年，我真的、真的非常需要，{i}我的陛下{/i}。"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_fabbba54:

    # mc "Don't worry, Elaris. I'll find a moment. Maybe even two."
    mc "别担心，埃拉里斯。我会找出时间的。也许还能有两次。"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_0519b203:

    # mc "Or even more. Who knows?"
    mc "甚至更多也说不定？谁知道呢。"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_55810db9:

    # mc "{sc=1}Ow, ow, ow! Alice!"
    mc "{sc=1}哎哟，哎哟，哎哟！爱丽丝！"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_fef02692:

    # a "What did you just say?"
    a "你刚才说什么了？"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_9d5a3637:

    # mc "{sc=1}I'll find time to take care of the kingdom! That's all I meant!"
    mc "{sc=1}我是说我会抽空处理王国的事！就是这个意思！"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_47f41647:

    # mc "{sc=1}I swear!"
    mc "{sc=1}我发誓！"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_2473e442:

    # a "You better."
    a "你最好是。"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_2b35b6fe_3:

    # mc "..."
    mc "……"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_cea01257:

    # mc "{i}*Whispering*{/i} Not now, Elaris." with dis5
    mc "{i}*低声说*{/i} 现在不行，埃拉里斯。" with dis5

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_99b3f2ee:

    # mc "{i}*Whispering*{/i} We'll talk about this later."
    mc "{i}*低声说*{/i} 这事以后再谈。"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_6dacd821:

    # a "What did you tell her?"
    a "你跟她说什么了？"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_24e936eb:

    # mc "That we aren't going to talk about that. As in, no way."
    mc "说我们不打算谈这个。绝对不谈。"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_2af3ecb8:

    # a "Hmph. You better not."
    a "哼。你最好别谈。"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_0d1ab162:

    # mc "Sorry, but that's not happening."
    mc "抱歉，那不可能。"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_adb28031:

    # mc "I don't do that kind of thing with women I've just met."
    mc "我不会跟刚认识的女人做那种事。"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_e9aeb97d:

    # a "Exactly. So back away from him, now."
    a "没错。所以现在，离他远点。"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_9a2476f2:

    # ela "Hmmm, I see, I see. I think I know what's going on here. I can sense it in the air."
    ela "嗯嗯，我明白了，我明白了。看来我知道这是怎么回事了。我能感觉到空气里的气氛。"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_5c5992ad:

    # ela "Well, if that's how it is, I won't push."
    ela "好吧，既然如此，我就不逼了。"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_e53eaf8b:

    # ela "I shall be fully satisfied if you simply allow me to hunt without restrictions, just as I did before."
    ela "只要您允许我像从前那样不受限制地狩猎，我就完全满足了。"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_a0704283:

    # mc "You need my permission for that?"
    mc "那也需要我的许可？"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_7b6638e0:

    # ela "Yes, you are my ruler. I shall do whatever you wish. Even if I do not like it."
    ela "是的，您是我的统治者。我会做任何您想的事。就算我并不情愿。"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_d5d1416a:

    # ela "Though I would dearly appreciate it if you took my needs into consideration, my Lord."
    ela "不过，我真心希望您能把我的需求考虑进去，我的陛下。"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_9a6fe0b2:

    # mc "(Anything? Hehe, that means-){p=0.8}{nw}"
    mc "（什么都行？嘿嘿，那就是说——）{p=0.8}{nw}"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_f1eb1946:

    # a "Before you think of anything, I'm saying {i}no{/i} right now. Don't even think about it."
    a "在你动任何念头之前，我先说{i}不{/i}。连想都别想。"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_d0da3671:

    # mc "I-I wasn't thinking about anything. Jeez."
    mc "我、我什么都没想。真是的。"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_0c419e79:

    # mc "To be honest, I don't really care what happens to the people of this world. I don't know them."
    mc "说实话，我根本不在乎这个世界的人会怎么样。我不认识他们。"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_572ac28c:

    # mc "If you want to hunt them, I don't see a problem. Go ahead."
    mc "你想猎杀他们，我看没什么问题。去吧。"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_f6056e4a:

    # ela "Marvelous. Thank you for your generosity, my Lord!"
    ela "太好了。感谢您的慷慨，我的陛下！"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_f982c0ea:

    # ela "I promise to serve you as best as I can. And with my regained power, I will be able to do so much more."
    ela "我保证会竭尽所能侍奉您。有了恢复的力量，我能做的事会多得多。"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_7b1a353e:

    # ela "You won't regret this decision."
    ela "您不会后悔这个决定的。"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_147729d8:

    # mc "I'm sorry, but I won't allow you to hunt men."
    mc "抱歉，我不会允许你猎杀男人。"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_277cbc54:

    # mc "I think the previous lord was right. People should live in peace, not in fear that they could die at any moment. That's no way to live."
    mc "我认为上一任陛下说得对。人们应该和平生活，而不是活在这种随时可能死去的恐惧里。那不叫生活。"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_9c6343c0:

    # mc "You'll have to make do with energy from the deceased."
    mc "你就将就从死者身上汲取能量吧。"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_2adba506:

    # ela "..."
    ela "……"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_f226dca3:

    # ela "As you wish."
    ela "如您所愿。"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_c89a32e8:

    # ela "If that is all, I shall return to my chambers."
    ela "如果没有别的事，我先回自己的房间了。"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_63fac992:

    # ela "It was a pleasure to meet you, my Lord. If you need me, simply speak my name."
    ela "很高兴认识您，我的陛下。需要我的时候，只需叫我的名字。"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_ad0e4df1:

    # mc "That's it? So, what are we supposed to do here?"
    mc "就这样？所以我们在这儿该干什么？"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_e20b9ff2:

    # ela "I told you. You can do whatever you want."
    ela "我说过了。您可以做任何想做的事。"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_3f1ca1d2:

    # mc "Yeah, but..."
    mc "是啊，可是……"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_a881add4:

    # a "Let's explore this place, [mc]! I'm sure we'll find tons of interesting stuff here."
    a "我们去探索一下这里吧，[mc]！我敢肯定能找到好多有趣的东西。"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_50e6db16:

    # ela "A wise idea. A ruler should know his-{p=1}{nw}"
    ela "明智的决定。统治者应该知道自——{p=1}{nw}"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_2adba506_1:

    # ela "..."
    ela "……"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_39c9698b:

    # ela "Unbelievable."
    ela "难以置信。"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_def0ad19:

    # mc "What is it?"
    mc "怎么了？"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_245e4b58:

    # ela "Someone's broken into the castle. It doesn't happen often."
    ela "有人闯进城堡了。这种事可不常有。"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_f864b5cc:

    # mc "What? Who?"
    mc "什么？谁？"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_673de2ad:

    # ela "Some human. Looks like a warrior."
    ela "某个人类。看起来像个战士。"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_73fb8505:

    # ela "He's moving quite fast and is heading straight for us. Likely with the intention of slaying the demon lord."
    ela "他移动得很快，正直奔我们而来。大概是想斩杀魔王。"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_82828f4c:

    # mc "Say what? But... I am a demon lord"
    mc "你说什么？可是……我现在就是魔王"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_c5eab966:

    # ela "Should I handle him, my Lord?"
    ela "需要我去处理他吗，我的陛下？"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_b06789f0:

    # mc "Ummm, yeah, I think-{p=1}{nw}"
    mc "呃，嗯，我想——{p=1}{nw}"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_7f7287c5:

    # a "Wait!"
    a "等等！"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_f3b7b305:

    # mc "(Oh, god. I'm scared of what she's gonna say.)"
    mc "（天啊。我好怕她要说什么。）"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_efe3cca9:

    # mc "What is it, Alice?"
    mc "怎么了，爱丽丝？"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_3fc5bc0d:

    # a "How about we have a little fun?"
    a "我们来找点乐子怎么样？"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_bbb55f1b:

    # mc "Fun? What kind of fun? What do you mean?"
    mc "乐子？什么乐子？你什么意思？"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_e8f34854:

    # a "You up for some roleplay? You know, pretend you're this almighty demon lord ruling the entire kingdom?"
    a "想不想来点角色扮演？就是说，假装你是那位统治整个王国的全能魔王？"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_ccdfcbf9:

    # mc "Well, technically, {i}I am{/i} one."
    mc "嗯，严格来说，{i}我确实是{/i}。"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_1dd47132:

    # a "Oh gosh, you know what I mean! A {i}real{/i}, menacing ruler."
    a "哎呀，你懂我的意思啦！一个{i}真正的{/i}、令人恐惧的统治者。"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_51885fb3:

    # a "The kind whose name alone makes people's legs shake with fear."
    a "那种光是名字就让人双腿发软的类型。"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_87d413f0:

    # a "The one who's got thousands of followers bowing because of his words and actions."
    a "那种因为一言一行就值得上千人俯首称臣的类型。"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_f6cedd24:

    # mc "Heh... Hehehe. Okay, okay. You've got my attention, keep going."
    mc "嘿……嘿嘿嘿。好吧好吧，你成功引起我的兴趣了，继续说。"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_aec7bcde:

    # a "Not much else to say. Let's let this warrior come in and play along. See what happens."
    a "要说的就这么多了。我们让那个战士进来一起演吧。看看会发生什么。"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_a5f309b6:

    # a "You'll be the demon lord, and I'll be your right-hand woman."
    a "你当魔王，我当你的左膀右臂。"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_46537517:

    # a "O-Or the other way around if you want. I wouldn't mind."
    a "或、或者你想反过来也行的。我不介意。"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_8c404969:

    # mc "Hmmm, okay, that might actually be fun."
    mc "嗯，好吧，那说不定还真挺有意思。"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_536f289b:

    # mc "But... what if he just attacks us? I have no idea what people here are capable of."
    mc "可是……万一他直接攻击我们怎么办？我完全不知道这里的人有多能打。"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_d7664eb2:

    # a "Elaris can help us out."
    a "埃拉里斯可以帮我们。"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_c06d5063:

    # mc "Ohhh! Okay, sounds good. I think we can pull this off."
    mc "哦哦！好主意。我觉得我们能行。"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_54b1c4b3:

    # mc "Elaris."
    mc "埃拉里斯。"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_7d29b4ce:

    # ela "Yes, my Lord?"
    ela "在，我的陛下？"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_b7345077:

    # mc "You don't have to go. Just hide somewhere. We'll welcome him right here in this hall."
    mc "你不用出面。找个地方藏起来就行。我们就在这座大厅里迎接他。"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_f226dca3_1:

    # ela "As you wish."
    ela "如您所愿。"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_776504ad:

    # mc "But if things get dangerous, or if I give you the signal, you take care of him, got it?"
    mc "但如果情况变得危险，或者我给你信号，你就来解决他，明白吗？"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_5ed744d2:

    # ela "Of course."
    ela "当然。"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_d62a109a:

    # a "You know, you already look like you're getting used to giving orders."
    a "你知道吗，你看起来已经很习惯发号施令了。"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_0573a2ba:

    # mc "What can I say? Born to be demon lord material."
    mc "我能说什么呢？天生就是当魔王的料。"

translate schinese aliceDateDemon_3cae74cc:

    # mc "Now, let's get ready to meet our guest."
    mc "好了，准备好迎接我们的客人吧。"

translate schinese mcDemonLord_194eef43:

    # mc "As a true ruler, I should be sitting proudly on my throne waiting for him to arrive."
    mc "作为一位真正的统治者，我应该端坐在王座上，等着他到来。"

translate schinese mcDemonLord_9e5fc8d8:

    # mc "Gotta strike some cool pose too, to look badass."
    mc "还得摆个帅气的姿势，看起来很酷很牛逼。"

translate schinese mcDemonLord_1ea515de:

    # mc "What do you think of this one?"
    mc "你觉得这个怎么样？"

translate schinese mcDemonLord_4e56969e:

    # a "Oh my god! That looks amazing."
    a "我的天！看起来太帅了。"

translate schinese mcDemonLord_277f7a2c:

    # a "Wait, don't move! I have to take a photo!"
    a "等等，别动！我得拍张照！"

translate schinese mcDemonLord_62177519:

    # a "Done!"
    a "拍好了！"

translate schinese mcDemonLord_72555505:

    # mc "You'll be my right-hand woman, Alice."
